PVD("vietnam_ndp_2016-2020",{"docs":["","VN NDP 2016 2020"],"s":{"1":[[1,"15","1","Tailored Governance Policies for Special Administrative Units","Perfect the roles, responsibilities and organization and formulate tailored policies for special urban, island authorities and administration-economic units.",""],[1,"15","1","Local Authority Model Reform","Renovate the local authority model with the aim of streamlined and effective organization.",""],[1,"15","2","Public Authority Management and Accountability Strengthening","Strengthen the management capability and accountability of the authorities at all levels, along with the monitoring and reviewing role of Vietnam Fatherland Front and other socio-political organizations during the formulation and implementation of policies.",""],[1,"15","3","Decentralization and Spatial Planning Reform","Perfect the decentralization, ensure the throughout consistency in leadership, management and administration from central to decentralized level.",""],[1,"107","5","Power Control and Monitoring Mechanisms","Establishing mechanisms to effectively control and monitor power.",""],[1,"107","5","Supervisory Role Strengthening for Elected Bodies and Mass Organizations","Promoting the supervisory role of elected bodies, Fatherland Front and mass",""],[1,"109","4","Decentralization and Regional Governance Reform","Completing the decentralization mechanism, ensuring uniformity and seamlessness in leadership, governance and administration from the Central to grassroot levels.",""],[1,"109","4","Investment and Budget Decentralization Reform","Improving the mechanism for investment and budgét decentralization, ensuring uniform governance in development planning and resource balancing.",""],[1,"109","4","Regional Development Coordination Regulations","Establishing effective regulations in regional development coordination and eliminating the problem of fragmentation in",""],[1,"110","1","Regional Coordination Body Consolidation","Consolidating regional coordinating bodies with the participation of related ministries and localities in the regions, with functions assigned to them by the Government and local administration, in order to effectively mobilize and utilize central and local resources.",""],[1,"110","2","Local Administration Organization and Service Delivery Reform","Improving the organization and operation of local administration, ensuring optimal services to the people and businesses.",""],[1,"113","2","Strengthened Monitoring Roles of Representative and Social Organizations","Strengthening the monitoring roles of the National Assembly, the People' Councils at all levels, the Vietnam Fatherland's Front and socio-political organizations, social and vocational organizations and of the communities.",""],[1,"113","3","Plan Implementation Communication and Public Dialogue Strengthening","Strengthening activities on the information and communication of the plan's implementation outcome, mechanisms and policies.",""]],"2":[[1,"9","5","Financial Market Restructuring","Continue to restructure the financial market for proper proportion between monetary market, capital market and insurance market.",""],[1,"9","5","Capital and Insurance Market Development","Develop the capital and insurance; promote healthy development of the stock exchange market with the restructure of monetary market activities to fit the new development era.",""],[1,"9","5","Insurance Effectiveness Improvement and Agricultural Insurance Promotion","Improve the effectiveness of insurance activities; promote agricultural insurance.",""],[1,"9","5","Credit Institution Restructuring and Bad Debt Resolution","Continue to restructure credit institutions with the objectives of processing bad debts, ensuring systemic soundness and applying international standards and practices in banking management.",""],[1,"35","9","Credit Institution Restructuring and Bank Supervision Measures","Has positively, proactively restructured credit institutions; closely monitored and restructured the weak joint-stock commercial banks with risks to collapse through measures such as reorganization, merger and acquisition with price 0 Vietnam dong, ...; has strengthened supervision and inspection, ensured system safety.",""],[1,"36","1","Non-Performing Loan Resolution Measures","Has implemented non-performing loan solutions; promoting the role of Vietnam Asset Management Company of credit institutions (VAMC).",""],[1,"36","2","Financial Sector Restructuring and Supervision Strengthening","Finance, securities, insurance companies have been gradually restructured; the inspection and supervision have been strengthened; increasing public information and transparency; operational efficiency has been improved.",""]],"3":[[1,"76","6","Banking Legal Framework Modernization","Innovate and improve the system of legal documents on banking activities, especially documents on the safety of banking operations, banking inspection, supervision, administration and operation of credit institutions in line with common practices, international standards and regulations of the State Bank Law, the Law on",""],[1,"77","1","Basel II Roadmap Implementation for Credit Institutions","Focus on implementing aggressively, effectively the roadmap for safe level standards of Basel II5 for credit institutions and branches of foreign banks.",""],[1,"77","1","Development of Multi-functional Credit Institutions","By 2020, strive to develop a system of multi-functional credit institutions in the direction of modern, safe operations, efficient and logical structure of ownership, size, type, able to compete in international integration process and is based on advanced technology, bank management to better meet the needs of the economy.",""],[1,"77","2","Credit Institution Restructuring and Bad Debt Resolution","Continue restructuring of credit institutions along with settling bad debts, ensuring system safety; implement transparency and apply new standards for banking management in accordance with international practice.",""],[1,"77","2","Long-Term Bad Debt Prevention Study","Research for a long-term solution to prevent bad debt incurred in the banking system, improve the operational efficiency of Vietnam's Credit Institutions Asset Management Company (VAMC).",""],[1,"77","3","Banking Inspection and Supervision Enhancement","Continue to innovate and improve the efficiency of banking inspections, supervision in line with practical requirements to sustain, maintenance discipline on money and banking markets.",""],[1,"77","3","Credit Institution Risk Monitoring and Early Warning System","Perform inspection, supervision and monitoring risks of credit institutions; develop CAMELS6 monitoring system, risk assessment system for credit institutions and early warning in banking activities.",""]],"4":[[1,"10","5","Integrated Infrastructure System Development","Continue to push for the strategic breakthrough of building the infrastructure system in sync with modern buildings",""],[1,"10","6","Socio-Economic Infrastructure Planning Enhancement","Enhance the quality of socio-economic infrastructure planning, ensure the overall efficiency and systemic aspects of planning, especially the transportation,",""],[1,"11","1","Infrastructure Construction and Transport Network Upgrading","Continue the constructions of roads, highways, the Northern - Southern railroad and upgrade the current railroad system, in-land and coastal waterway network.",""],[1,"90","2","Economic and Social Infrastructure Investment Programme","Investing in order to basically complete economic and social infrastructures such as: seaports, tourist attractions, economic zones, industrial parks, border economic zones; infrastructure in irrigation, transport, telecommunication, power supply, urban and rural infrastructure, ...",""],[1,"94","4","Infrastructure Investment Legal and Policy Reform","Improving the laws, mechanisms and policies to create favorable conditions for different economic sectors, including foreign investments, to invest and do business in infrastructure in various forms, especially in public-private partnership (PPP) in conformity with international practices.",""],[1,"95","2","Development Investment Capital Mobilization and Infrastructure Completion","Attracting and efficiently utilizing development investment capital, basically completing the essential economic and social infrastructure system in order to achieve the socioeconomic development targets for the period 2016 - 2020.",""],[1,"95","6","PPP Legal Framework Completion","Continuing on the completion of the PPP legal framework in a clear, stable and fair manner in order to motivate enterprises to take part in the investments processes of infrastructures via suitable PPP models such as: BOT, BT, BTO, ...",""],[1,"96","4","Capital Disbursement Promotion Measures","Continuing to enhance measures that promote disbursement of capital.",""]],"5":[[1,"8","7","Public-Private Investment Mobilization and Budget Reallocation","Appropriately allocate governmental financial resources to participate in and boost investments from non-governmental sector.",""],[1,"35","5","Public-Private Partnership Investment Promotion for Large Infrastructure and Public Service Projects","The encouragement of investment in form of public-private partnership (PPP) for important large projects with high efficiency and large spillovers to socio-economic development in local, inter-region which are considered to be important measures to attract additional resources from the business sector investment in infrastructure and public services.",""],[1,"35","5","Decentralized PPP Project Appraisal and Refinement Process","In the past year 2015, the implementation of Decree No. 15/2015/ ND-CP, with the decentralization of the implementation of PPP projects, many project proposals of ministries, sectors and local governments have been reviewed and refined to be able to choose the projects with high feasibility to put into practice.",""],[1,"35","7","Non-State Investment Attraction Policy Reform","Improve mechanisms and policies to attract non-state investment.",""],[1,"67","5","Domestic Resource Mobilization and External Resource Utilization for Rapid and Sustainable Development","Utilize best domestic resources, and proactive international integration, mobilization and effective use of external resources to develop quickly and sustainably.",""],[1,"97","5","Mobilization of Non-Governmental Investment","Appropriately disposing State's financial resources and at the same time promoting non-governmental sectors' investments.",""],[1,"97","6","ODA-Financed Large-Scale Socio-Economic Infrastructure Investment","Prioritizing on the execution of important and essential large-scale socio-economic infrastructure projects (in the fields of transportation, electricity, water, irrigation, offshore fishing, telecommunication and information technology infrastructure, education and healthcare); agricultural and rural development; completion of modern market economy institutions conforming",""],[1,"98","2","State Credit Investment in Direct Payback Projects","Continuing to invest in projects capable of direct payback in the following economic sectors: agricultural, forestry and seafood processing facilities, salt processing facilities; export goods manufacturing projects, especially labor-intensive ones; concentrated material forests, perennial crops, fruit trees; projects that develop infrastructure for aquaculture; projects that implement the Government's policies in the socialization in education, healthcare, culture, sport; allocating counterpart capital for projects that utilize official development assistance (ODA) capital; infrastructure in transport, water supply, social housing ;...",""],[1,"99","1","PPP Infrastructure Development Prioritization","Prioritizing PPP projects that help develop infrastructures; improving the economic efficiency of FDI firms and at the same time preventing transfer pricing and tax avoidance.",""]],"6":[[1,"13","5","Multi-sector Disaster Prevention and Climate Change Adaptation Schemes","formulate and implement natural disaster prevention and anti-climate change schemes in every sector, prioritize ODA and State budget funds to invest in infrastructure at vital location to mitigate damage and casualties, disseminate measures of preventing and coping with each level of impact from climate change to the population.",""],[1,"13","6","Ecological Adaptation Support for Communities","Assign the Government to submit to the Standing Committee of the National Assembly for decision on investment and support to the people to cope with ecological condition changes.","the Government | the Standing Committee of the National Assembly"],[1,"44","3","Integrated Climate Change Response and Disaster Prevention Projects","Many projects combining climate change response and natural disaster prevention are deployed, with the cooperation and support of many partners.",""],[1,"89","3","Regional Economic Restructuring and Climate Response Measures","maximizing the potential and advantages of the provinces in the region, especially industrial, service and maritime economic advantages; promoting economic restructuring, shifting the growth model towards efficient use of resources, protecting the ecological environment; establishing solutions to prevent and respond to climate change.",""],[1,"92","3","Environmental Protection Coordination for Climate Change Response","Enhancing the coordination with ministries and other localities in the field of environmental protection in connection with measures that actively respond to climate change.",""],[1,"92","4","Mekong Delta Regional Development Adjustment for Climate Change","Realizing the impacts of climate change to adjust the partition for regional development on the basis of key areas of the Mekong Delta region, the areas along Tien and Hau rivers and the area in transition to Ho Chi Minh city.",""],[1,"93","2","Integrated Urban and Economic Zone Spatial Planning","Organizing urban space and linking urban areas in a way that promotes sustainable development, green growth and adaption to climate change; organizing border economic zones, coastal economic zones and concentrated industrial zones in connection to urban space, economic corridors and focal technical infrastructure;",""],[1,"105","1","Climate Change Adaptation and Environmental Protection Measures","Enhancing the State's governance, improving the legal system, mechanisms, policies and synchronously implementing solutions to actively respond and adapt to climate change, preventing natural disasters, managing natural resources and protecting the environment.",""],[1,"105","2","Disaster Forecasting and Early Warning Enhancement","Enhancing the capability to forecast and warn of natural disasters, monitoring climate change.",""],[1,"105","2","Multi-Stakeholder Disaster Prevention and Rescue Coordination","Highlighting the roles of line industries, authorities and the armed forces; promoting the roles of the community, enterprises and enhancing international cooperation, effectively implementing prevention of natural disasters, responding to climate change and improving the efficiency of search and rescue missions.",""],[1,"105","2","Natural Disaster and Drought Mitigation Projects","First of all, focusing on the completion of projects that alleviate the consequences of natural disasters and drought in the Highland and Central Southern provinces, urgent projects that prevent saline and improve the people's life and production of crops.",""],[1,"105","2","Climate Resilience and Flood Prevention Investment","Improving resilience to natural disasters; mobilizing resources to invest in projects to respond to climate change and prevent natural disasters; preventing urban flooding.",""],[1,"105","2","Relocation of Residents from Eroded Areas","Basically completing the relocation of people living in eroded areas.",""]],"7":[[1,"14","1","Forest Protection and Development Institutional Strengthening","Strengthen the organizational structure, forces, operating mechanism with synchronous measures to protect and develop forests; especially in the coastal protection forest, watershed forests, special use forests (SUF), nature conservation and biodiversity.",""],[1,"87","3","Sustainable Ecological Agriculture Development","Establishing a sustainable ecological agriculture based on a combination of agricultural and forestry production in order to protect and develop forest resources, protect the ecological environment, develop specialized areas for industrial crops, fruit trees, medicinal plants and exports.",""],[1,"87","3","National Environmental Park and Nature Reserve Protection","Establishing and protecting the national environmental park system, planning and protecting natural reserves in order to conserve genes of rare animals and plants, also developing ecotourism.",""],[1,"87","3","Upstream Protection Forest System Development","Establishing and protecting systems of upstream protection forests in large rivers and lakes.",""],[1,"87","3","Forest Restoration and Afforestation Initiative","Creating areas for natural forest restoration and rapidly greening barren lands in vital areas, promoting afforestation; completing the allocation of lands and forests in relation to agricultural settlement; putting an end to the problem of deforestation for agricultural production.",""],[1,"93","2","Conservation of River Landscapes and Natural Ecosystems","conserving river landscapes, orchards, mangrove forests, flooded forests, natural reserves and national parks;",""]],"8":[[1,"13","1","Counterfeit and Contraband Goods Control and Food Safety Enforcement","Strictly and effectively control, handle, and prevent counterfeits, contraband goods, goods that fail to meet the food safety standards or of unclear origin, and limit their effect to the lives and business of the people and enterprises.",""],[1,"13","5","Natural Resource and Mineral Governance Reform","Enhance the management of natural resources and minerals, and environment protection; require transparent bidding for new resource and mineral mining permits abiding new regulations;",""],[1,"13","5","Environmental Pollution Inspection and Enforcement","Inspect and handle environmental pollution, especially in countryside areas, traditional crafting villages, industrial clusters and valley areas.",""],[1,"107","1","Environmental Pollution Control and Remediation Programme","Implementing socialization in environmental protection and remediation.",""],[1,"107","1","Emission Standards and Technology Roadmap","Implementing emission regulations and standards and technologies following appropriate roadmaps.",""],[1,"107","1","Forest Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Programme","Enhancing the protection and sustainable development of forests, especially coastal protection forests, upstream forests, special use forests; conserving the nature, promoting biodiversity, protecting and restoring fishery resources.",""],[1,"107","1","Renewable Energy and Environment-Friendly Materials Promotion","Encouraging the use of renewable energy, new materials that are environment friendly.",""],[1,"107","2","Integration of Sustainable Development Criteria in State Budget Project Appraisal","there is a need to ensure the integration of considerations for sustainable development, climate change and green growth.",""],[1,"107","2","Maritime Planning and Resource Management Strengthening","Strengthening planning, baseline surveys, maritime resource and environment management to serve maritime economic development.",""]],"9":[[1,"11","3","High-Quality Human Resource Development Initiative","Focus on education to produce high quality human resource, improve the quality of training, and provide sufficient number of skilled labours to meet the requirements of economic development, make most of the golden population era and increase the chance of the people to get employed.",""],[1,"11","3","Productivity Enhancement Policy Mechanism","Perfect mechanism and policies to significantly boost productivity.",""],[1,"29","4","Human Resources, Science and Technology Policy Improvement","Legal systems, mechanisms and policies to develop human resources, science and technology continued to be improved.",""],[1,"30","2","Continuing Education Strengthening and Reorganization","Continuing education has been strengthened and developed towards implementation of multiple tasks, no new construction during this period but reorganizing; learning society establishment has been implemented synchronously from central to local levels.",""],[1,"30","4","Higher Education Quality and Efficiency Improvement","Higher education implemented focus conversion in developing human resources from increase in quantity to improvement in quality and efficiency.",""],[1,"30","4","Higher Education Network Improvement","Higher education network continues to be perfected.",""],[1,"69","4","Human Resource Development and Education Reform","Develop quickly human resources, especially high-quality human resources, focusing on fundamental and comprehensive innovation of national education, closely linked the development of human resources with development and application of science and technology.",""],[1,"69","4","High-Quality Talent Training and Expert Development","Focus on training high-quality human resources; trained team of leading experts in the field, especially in the field of new, modern industries, with special emphasis on improving the quality of teaching staff, scientific researchers; attracting and training talented people in the field of foreign affairs, the state management sector and businesses, as well as leading sectors.",""],[1,"69","4","Comprehensive Education System Reform","Human resource development should go hand in hand with a comprehensive reform of education systems.",""],[1,"69","4","Curriculum, Teaching Method, and Learning Innovation","Strongly innovate on contents, programs, methods of teaching and learning at all levels and grades.",""],[1,"69","4","Equal Educational Opportunity and Social Support Measures","Implement well equality of educational opportunities and social policies in education.",""],[1,"70","1","Education System Renovation and Quality Improvement","In renovating the education system, there needs to be focus on improving the quality of teachers, the application of new teaching and learning models such as online, mobile, expanding information sharing the network, and enhance the effectiveness of the universities and colleges by encouraging private investment in education.",""]],"10":[[1,"70","1","Vocational Training Reform and Labor Market Alignment","Innovate and improve the quality of vocational training; associate vocational training with the labor needs of the business and production sectors.",""],[1,"70","1","Agricultural and Rural Economic Training Programme","Focus on training for agricultural production and rural economic development.",""],[1,"75","3","High-Quality Human Resource Development","Strongly develop high-quality human resource market, particularly skilled labor and business management personnel.",""],[1,"81","4","Rural Skills Training and Labor Market Information Support","promote training with diverse, suitable forms, promote economic growth, job creation, income generation and economic restructuring, rural labor structure.",""],[1,"81","4","Rural Labor Market Information System","Strengthen information on the labor market in rural areas to help workers identify job opportunities effectively locally as well as abroad.",""],[1,"83","8","High-Quality Human Resource Training and Health Care Services Development","Encourage all economic sectors to strongly develop services in health, education, culture, arts, sports, ... especially high-quality services for human resource training and health care.",""],[1,"88","8","Education and Training Investment Promotion","Promoting investments in education and training in order to train human",""],[1,"90","3","Vocational Education and High-Quality Human Resource Training","Promoting vocational education and training, especially high-quality human resource training to meet the development demands of the region.",""],[1,"92","3","High-Quality Human Resources Training","Rapidly developing human resources training, especially high-quality human resources in order to meet the demand for international integration of the region and the nation.",""],[1,"99","2","Workforce Improvement and High-Quality Labor Development","Consistently implementing mechanisms, policies and solutions in order to improve the workforce, especially high- quality workforce that corresponds to the demand for socio-economic development.",""],[1,"99","2","Education System Innovation and Learning Society Development","Thoroughly innovating the education system in an open manner, integrating and creating a learning society, thoroughly developing the people's capability, physique, personality, morals, lifestyles, respect for the laws and civic responsibility.",""],[1,"99","2","High-Quality Workforce Development for Sustainable Growth","Paying attention in the development of high-quality workforce as a foundation for sustainable economic development.",""],[1,"99","3","Education Curriculum and Assessment Reform","Implementing the innovation in education programme framework and textbooks in a way that enhances comprehensive education, reducing the content load and transforming from a content-intensive education to one that comprehensively develop both the capability, practical skills, personality and life skills for the students; reducing the number of compulsory subjects and providing more choices for electives.",""],[1,"99","3","Vocational Training Modernization","Regarding vocational training, enhancing education of practical-skill oriented workforce, on working style and job responsibilities for students, ensuring the satisfaction of demands for technical and technological jobs of domestic and international labour markets.",""],[1,"99","3","Undergraduate Education Quality and Specialization Reform","Regarding undergraduate level, focusing on the education of high-quality workforce and talented students; developing creativity, practical skills, professional ethics and social knowledge, gradually approaching international level of science and technology advances.",""],[1,"99","3","Education and Vocational Assessment Reform","Innovating the goals, content and procedures of in- class tests and finals, and also the evaluation of education and vocational training results.",""],[1,"99","3","Education and Vocational Pathway Integration","Enhancing professional orientation and interconnection in education and vocational training.",""],[1,"99","3","Differentiated Undergraduate Institutional Development","Developing undergraduate education in a way that specializes undergraduate institutions into research-oriented institutions, application-oriented institutions and practice-oriented institutions.",""],[1,"100","1","Teacher and School Management Capacity Development for Educational Innovation","teachers and managing officers to satisfy the demands for educational innovation.",""],[1,"100","1","Education-Science and Technology Linkage Initiative","Linking education with scientific researches, technological transfers and promoting scientists as in-class lecturers.",""],[1,"100","2","Education Financing Equality and School Autonomy Reform","Implementing equality on the right to receive the State's financial support between students learning in public and non-pubic education institutions.",""],[1,"100","2","Vocational Training System Reform and Labour Market Linkages","Promote vocational training and linking between vocational training and businesses.",""],[1,"100","2","Student Financial Support Mechanisms","Establishing concessional credit policies to help students in financial need.",""],[1,"100","2","Talent Identification and Utilization Mechanism","Establishing special mechanism in order to select and utilize talented people.",""],[1,"100","3","Workforce Governance and Allocation Reform","Improving State's governance on the workforce, linking demands and supplies for the workforce.",""],[1,"100","3","Workforce Restructuring and Efficient Allocation Measures","Enhancing and creating conditions for the restructuring and also reasonable and effective allocation of the workforce.",""]],"11":[[1,"11","4","National Science, Technology, and Innovation Promotion Framework","Enhance the scientific and technological capability and formulate a national system for creative activities, promote creativity from individuals, enterprises and organizations.",""],[1,"11","4","Breakthrough Policies for Scientific Research and Technological Innovation","Formulate and promulgate breakthrough policies in order to encourage scientific researches and technological innovations, apply new technologies into productions to increase productivity and goods' value.",""],[1,"11","4","Enterprise Technology Adoption Support","Allow and encourage enterprises in every sector to develop and apply new technologies.",""],[1,"11","4","Intellectual Property Valuation and Protection Reform","Perfect the regulation for valuing intellectual properties, strengthen intellectual property protection, and handle violations.",""],[1,"11","4","Technology Import Support and Control Measures","Support the import of source technology, high technology and closely control technology imports.",""]],"12":[[1,"11","4","Research Budget Transparency and Output-Based Procurement Mechanism","Conduct output-based order, bidding and advances and ensure the transparency in research budgeting and result.",""],[1,"11","4","Science and Technology Development Fund Strengthening","Enhance the effectiveness of science and technology development funds; encourage venture funds.",""],[1,"11","4","Modern Technology Research and Application Institutes","Establish institutes for researching and applying modern technology, development creative centres and technology gardens.",""],[1,"27","2","Business Incubator and Venture Capital Support","Business incubators, venture capital funds have been gradually formed and developed, creating more favorable conditions for supporting the formation and development of enterprise high-tech applications.",""],[1,"31","4","Science and Technology Market Development","Develop science, technology market, enhance the activity connecting supply - demand, technological transaction values increased on average by 13.5%/year.",""],[1,"31","4","Technology Exchange Conferences and Innovation Exhibitions","Successfully organize conference technology exchanges, exhibitions introducing innovative products of the research team from the University.",""],[1,"31","4","Support for Science and Technology Enterprises","Much of the content is implemented to support and establish enterprises in science and technology and enterprises investing in technological innovation.",""],[1,"31","4","Research Institute-University-Business Collaboration Models","Forming some models of effective cohesion between research institutes, universities and enterprises in scientific activities and technology.",""]],"13":[[1,"12","5","Population-Wide Health Insurance Expansion","Speed up the implementation of population-wide health insurance.",""],[1,"104","2","Non-Public Healthcare Development and Public-Private Partnership Hospital Models","Establishing favorable conditions for non-public healthcare development, piloting the establishments of public-private partnership healthcare institutions and models that govern hospitals as public enterprises.",""],[1,"104","2","Universal Health Insurance Acceleration","Accelerating the schedule of universal healthcare insurance.",""],[1,"104","2","Healthcare Financing Reform and Fee Adjustment Roadmap","Innovating financial mechanism, correctly adjusting the prices for healthcare services according to roadmap and ensuring publicity and transparency; at the same time appropriately assisting policy beneficiaries, the poor and the disadvantaged.",""]],"14":[[1,"12","5","Satellite Hospital and Family Doctor Model Expansion","Expand the satellite hospital model and family doctor model.",""],[1,"40","3","Healthcare Quality Improvement and High-Technology Treatment","Quality of healthcare and treatment has been raised, has applied scientific achievements of high technology.",""],[1,"40","3","Hospital Overcrowding Reduction Measures","Has actively deployed multiple solutions to reduce overcrowding in hospitals and has achieved initial results.",""],[1,"40","3","District, Provincial, and Central Hospital Investment","Focus on investment in building system of district, provincial and end hospitals.",""],[1,"41","1","Public Hospital Renovation and Upgrade Programme","Public hospital system has been renovated and upgraded from the state budget, Government bonds.",""],[1,"41","1","Hospital Construction and Modernization Programme","Has completed 610/766 hospital, has been building 05 central hospitals and modern end hospital par with advanced countries in the region, hospital system satellites were formed in many provinces and cities.",""],[1,"41","1","Health Care Process Reform and Quality Monitoring","Reform of processes and procedures in health care and improvement of inspection and monitoring have contributed to gradually enhance the quality of healthcare at all levels.",""],[1,"41","2","Military-Civilian Medical Facility Network Development","combined health facilities network of military-civilian-medical has continued to be invested and developed.",""],[1,"103","3","Healthcare Quality and Rehabilitation Improvement Programme","Improving the quality of healthcare and rehabilitation at all levels.",""],[1,"103","3","Traditional Medicine Development and Integration Initiative","Developing traditional medicine, promoting researches, inheritance, application and dissemination of remedies, disease prevention methods and treatments using traditional medicine, combining traditional medicine with modern medicine; cultivating and processing domestically sourced medicinal plants.",""],[1,"103","3","Primary and Preventive Healthcare Strengthening","Focusing on initial healthcare, developing systems of preventive medicine, actively preventing diseases and epidemics.",""],[1,"103","3","Hospital Overload Reduction Measures","Synchronously implementing measures to quickly resolve the problem of patient overload in hospitals.",""],[1,"103","3","Healthcare Network Expansion and Referral Hospital Construction","Improving the healthcare institution network, especially in the mountainous regions, frontier and islands; completing the construction of some tertiary referral hospitals; scaling up the model of satellite clinics and family doctors.",""],[1,"103","3","Healthcare Administrative Reform and Digitalization","Promoting the reform of administrative procedures, the application of information technology, management standards and treatment service quality.",""],[1,"103","3","Healthcare Workforce Training and Development","Promote training and development of the healthcare workforce, both in terms of quality, quantity and structure.",""],[1,"104","1","Healthcare Workforce Development and Deployment","Paying attention to the development of high-level healthcare workforce, strengthening the workforce in rural and mountainous regions, frontier and islands.",""]],"15":[[1,"12","2","Policy Support for People with Meritorious Services","Continue to perfect the policy and improve the living standards for people with meritorious services.",""],[1,"12","2","Pro-Poor Policy Measures","Synchronously implement policies and measures in order to achieve sustainable pro-poor goals, limit the number of households regressing to poverty, and reduce the number of especially poor districts and communes according to the National poor standards of 2016 - 2020 by 4 percent per year.",""],[1,"12","4","Social Security System Expansion and Modernization","Expand the participant, improve the efficiency of the system, modernize the financial operation, and ensure the sustainable development of the social security fund.",""],[1,"12","4","Community-Based Social Support Policy Enhancement","Continue to perfect the policy, encourage the participation of the community, and enhance the efficiency of social support.",""],[1,"12","4","Minimum Basic Social Services Guarantee","Ensure the minimum provision of basic social services such as education, health care, housing, water, and information to the people.",""],[1,"62","2","Social Security and Rural Development Support","Third, regularly take care of social security, improve people's lives, and develop agricultural, rural, remote and ethnic minority areas, especially those under difficult socio-economic conditions.",""],[1,"69","3","Social Justice and Social Protection Policy Measures","Also, utilize State resources, regulatory tools, distribution and redistribution policy to realize progressive social justice, social security, poverty reduction, gradually improving social welfare and material life, the spirit of the people.",""]],"16":[[1,"87","1","Development Support for Economically Difficult Areas","Establishing conditions for development in areas with economic difficulties, especially in the mountains, frontiers, islands, the Northwest region, the Central Highlands, the Southwest region and West Central provinces.",""],[1,"88","2","Resettlement Support for Communities Affected by Irrigation and Hydropower Projects","basically completing the resettlement of people, especially the resettlement of people living in the areas where irrigation and hydropower projects take place",""],[1,"88","2","Border Settlement and Migration Management","Moving people who are willing to the borders, basically resolving the problem of arbitrary migration",""],[1,"88","2","Ethnic Minority Infrastructure and Livelihood Improvement","gradually improving the infrastructure, cultural and economic conditions for the ethnic minority",""],[1,"90","4","Ethnic Minority Policy Support","Implementing well policies regarding ethnic people, truly improving the material and cultural life of ethnic people.",""],[1,"94","1","Transport Infrastructure Investment in Disadvantaged Areas","Paying attention to investments in transportation infrastructure in areas with difficult economic conditions.",""],[1,"102","3","Social Security Governance and Poverty Reduction Reform","Reviewing and improving the legal system, improving the efficiency of State's governance on social security.",""],[1,"102","3","Poverty Reduction Policies for War Veterans","Continuing to improve policies to heighten the living standards of people that have contributed in war times.",""],[1,"102","3","Accelerated Poverty Eradication in Difficult and Ethnic Minority Regions","Promoting sustainable poverty reduction, especially in particularly difficult regions and establishing specific policies to eradicate poverty at a faster rate in ethnic minority-based regions.",""],[1,"102","3","Self-Reliance Support for Poor and Near-Poor Households","Focusing on the solutions that facilitate conditions and encourage the poor and the near poor to sustainably escape from poverty by themselves, especially for people capable of working.",""],[1,"102","3","Conditional Poverty Support Mechanism","Implementing conditional support depending on the subject, geography and support period in order to improve access to polices and encourage active participation of the poor.",""],[1,"102","3","Targeted Poverty Eradication in Northern Mountainous, Highland, and Southwest Provinces","For the difficult provinces in the Northern mountainous area, the Highland and the Southwest, establishing and implementing specific proposals and solutions to eradicate poverty, supporting and establishing conditions for the poor to develop production and increase income through labor mobility.",""],[1,"102","3","Education, Nutrition, and Sanitation Measures for Ethnic Minority Children","For ethnic minority-based regions, implementing measures on education, nutrition and sanitation to narrow the gap in opportunities for ethnic minority children.",""],[1,"102","3","Livelihood Support and Legal Assistance for the Poor","Focusing on the implementation of measures to raise awareness, change the way of doing business, provide legal support along with vocational training, career inheritance based on crops and livestock to motivate the poor.",""],[1,"102","3","Targeted Job Loss Allowance and Social Security Benefits","Implementing polices on the right basis, right subjects and for the right periods for employees losing their jobs, especially basis of unemployment insurance, social security, job loss allowance according to the regulations",""],[1,"103","1","Community-Based Social Support Improvement","Continuing to improve policies, promoting community participation, improving the efficiency of social support activities, including the improvement in methods of identifying people in poverty and vulnerable households.",""],[1,"103","1","Disability Social Integration and Access to Education","Implementing the process of social integration for the disabled, ensuring the opportunities to get access to education for disabled children and creating opportunities for disabled people to gain support themselves through the help of social organizations.",""],[1,"103","1","Monitoring Mechanism for Disability Social Integration","Establishing regular monitoring mechanism upon the implementation of social integration for the disabled.",""],[1,"103","1","Multidimensional Poverty Line and Basic Social Services Guarantee","Implementing the poverty line based on a multi-dimensional approach, ensuring the minimum level of income and basic social services such as education, healthcare, housing, clean water supply and access to information.",""],[1,"110","2","Public Service, Social Security, and Welfare Improvement","Focusing on providing public services, ensuring social security, improving social welfare and the people's living standards.",""]],"17":[[1,"13","3","Elderly Care and Family Support Measures","Pay more attention to family issues, health care for the elderly and promote their roles.",""],[1,"104","5","Ethnic and Religious Policy Implementation","Implementing policies in ethnic and religion, ensuring freedom of religion.",""],[1,"104","6","Popular and Professional Sports Development","Developing popular and professional sport activities.",""],[1,"104","6","Elderly Care and Social Role Promotion","Taking care of and promoting the role of the elderly.",""],[1,"104","6","Gender Equality and Women's Advancement Measures","Effectively implementing measures for the sake gender equality and advancement of women.",""],[1,"104","6","Child Protection, Care, and Education Measures","Protecting, taking care of and educating children.",""],[1,"104","6","Children's Rights Implementation","Gradually implementing children's right.",""],[1,"104","6","Youth Development Strategy Implementation","Continuing to implement the youth development strategy for the period 2011-2020.",""]],"18":[[1,"15","4","National Defence and Security Enhancement","Enhance national defence and security; ensure the independence, sovereignty and territorial integrity, maintain socio-political stability and peace for the development of our nation",""],[1,"15","5","Armed Forces Modernization and Readiness Programme","Develop the People's Army, People's Police to be revolutionary, regular, elite, and incrementally modern, prioritize to modernize several armed forces, ensure appropriate number, combat-readiness, good accomplishment of missions.",""],[1,"15","5","Naval Enforcement Capacity Enhancement","Enhance the effectiveness of naval enforcer forces.",""],[1,"15","5","Militia and Reserve Force Development","Focus on developing the self- defence militia and mobilization reserve forces; develop defence and security industries.",""],[1,"15","5","Defence and Security Industries Development","develop defence and security industries.",""],[1,"15","6","National Defence and Maritime Security Strengthening","Strengthen the national defence and people's security formation, especially in the islands; proactively protect our maritime sovereignty, sovereign rights, national and people's maritime interests.",""],[1,"82","5","Defense and Security Industry Development","Develop a solid, effective defense and security industry.",""],[1,"82","5","Dual-Use Enterprise Development","Properly develop enterprises capable of producing dual use products.",""],[1,"82","5","Defense Industry Consortium Formation","Gradually form defense industry consortium with the participation of various types of enterprises.",""],[1,"110","3","National Defense Strategy Implementation","Implementing National Defense Strategy to cope with the new situation.",""],[1,"110","3","National Defense and Security Policy Framework","Establishing the Party's military policies, defense and security strategy to cope with the new situation.",""],[1,"110","3","People's Army and Police Modernization","Developing the people's revolution army and police force in a professional way, making gradual modernization, prioritizing certain armed services and armed forces, ensuring that a reasonable number of forces are capable of high fighting capacity and able to complete missions well.",""],[1,"110","3","Maritime Law Enforcement Capacity Enhancement","Strengthening and improving operational efficiency of maritime law enforcement forces.",""],[1,"110","3","Militia and Reserve Force Development","Emphasizing the development of militia and reserve forces; developing national defense and security industry.",""],[1,"110","3","National Defense and Security Industry Development","Emphasizing the development of militia and reserve forces; developing national defense and security industry.",""],[1,"110","3","National Defense Education and Civic Responsibility Promotion","Promoting the education of responsibilities and obligations of citizens in national defense and security.",""],[1,"110","4","Border Patrol Road Construction","Constructing border patrol roads.",""],[1,"110","4","Improvement of National Defense Economic Zones","Improving the operational efficiency of national defense economic zones",""],[1,"110","4","Special Missions Policy Framework for National Defense and Security","Establishing suitable policies to operate special missions regarding national defense and security.",""],[1,"111","1","National Defense and Border Demarcation Completion","utilizing the support of the international community to maintain peaceful environment, strengthening national defense, security and protect national sovereignty, urgently completing the process of border demarcation.",""]],"19":[[1,"70","3","National Electricity Infrastructure Development","Review overall national electrical schematics; invest in development of electricity infrastructure.",""],[1,"72","5","Electricity Generation Capacity Expansion","In the period of 2016 - 2020, the electricity industry is expected to complete and put into operation 21,870 MW.",""],[1,"72","5","Power Grid Construction Programme","Grid construction volume in period 2016 - 2020 is more than 2,400 km of 500 kV lines, 7,000 km of 220 kV lines, more than 24,000 MVA and 500 kV power station capacity and over 39,000 MVA 220 kV station.",""],[1,"93","5","Regional Power Supply Planning and Grid Upgrading","Identifying the criteria and standards for power supply throughout the region; forecasting the demand for power, defining loads and power consumption; encouraging the use of renewable and clean energy.",""]],"20":[[1,"14","1","Clean and Renewable Energy Promotion Policies","There were policies to encourage the production and use of new energy, renewable energy, saving, efficient and environmentally friendly.",""],[1,"82","4","Renewable Energy Development Support","Support the development of renewable energy sources, especially wind, solar energy.",""]],"21":[[1,"79","6","Import Management and Domestic Supply Support","Actively adjust the speed of goods imports, along with producing and developing raw materials, fuels and auxiliary service export sectors, to meet domestic demand and the development of supporting industries, strictly control discouraged commodity imports, contribute to reduce the deficit in the long term.",""]],"22":[[1,"13","3","Sports Promotion and Professional Sports Development","Promote sports to common people as well as develop professional sports.",""],[1,"42","4","Mass Sports Development and Sports Facilities Upgrade","Mass sports continued to be developed with various forms.",""],[1,"42","4","High-Performance Sports Development","High performance sport has developed;",""],[1,"42","4","Sports Technical Facilities Upgrade and Construction","Technical facilities for sport has been gradually upgraded and constructed;",""],[1,"42","4","International Cultural and Sports Cooperation","Exchange and international cooperation in culture, sports have prospered",""]],"23":[[1,"13","2","Cultural Creativity and Heritage Promotion","Encourage creativity in cultural, literature and artistic activities along with promote civil responsibilities, social responsibilities of artists and cultural activists.",""],[1,"13","2","Authors' Rights Protection Implementation","Better the implementation of authors' rights protection.",""],[1,"13","3","Media and Publishing Development","Develop the media and publishing effectively and healthily to meet the requirements of developing and protecting our nation and satisfy the ever-rising demand of the people.",""],[1,"13","3","Socialization of Cultural Activities","Promote socialization of cultural activities.",""],[1,"42","2","Cultural Life Promotion and Arts Legal Framework Development","The mass movement of building cultural life was promoted.",""],[1,"42","2","Legal Framework Completion for Cultural and Creative Activities","Other cultural activities such as: cinema activities, performing arts activities; art works, photography and exhibitions; copyright works were also pushed towards completing the legal framework for creating open, fair art environment, to better meet the political requirements and cultural enjoyment needs of people.",""],[1,"82","1","Cultural Development Policy Implementation","Implement effectively cultural development policy, implement progress, social justice and improve the lives of people in the rural areas.",""],[1,"82","1","Village Traditions Preservation and Promotion","Preserve and promote the traditions, customs and practices of the villages of Vietnam.",""],[1,"87","4","Ethnic Minority Cultural Preservation and Community Tourism Development","Conserving and promoting cultural values of the ethnic minority in connection with the development of community tourism .",""],[1,"87","4","Cultural and Sports Institutions Development","establishing and improving cultural and sport institutions with the aim to enhance the capability to meet the demands of cultural enjoyment of the people in order to close the gap with the people living in delta regions.",""],[1,"88","7","Traditional Craft Village and Ecotourism Development","Paying attention to the development of traditional craft villages and ecotourism with agricultural products and export-oriented handicraft products of the locality.",""],[1,"92","2","Cultural and Sports Quality Improvement and Heritage Preservation","Improving the quality of cultural and sport activities.",""],[1,"104","4","Cultural Governance Strengthening","Strengthening the leadership role of the Party, improving the efficiency of the State's governance on culture.",""],[1,"104","4","National Cultural Development and Preservation Initiative","Developing Vietnam's culture, preserving the positive characteristics of the people, adapting the quintessence of world's cultures and meeting the needs for international integration and development.",""],[1,"104","4","Comprehensive Human Development and Healthy Cultural Environment","Comprehensively developing the people of Vietnam and creating healthy and civilized cultural environment in all aspects of social life, overcoming the degradation of social morality.",""],[1,"104","4","Cultural Institutions Efficiency Improvement","Improving the efficiency of cultural institutions.",""],[1,"104","4","Cultural Family Model Expansion and Family-School-Society Coordination","Establishing and expanding the model of cultural family, strengthening the coordination between families, schools and the society.",""],[1,"104","5","Cultural Freedom and Heritage Promotion Policy","Encouraging creativity freedom in cultural activities, literature and arts along with promoting civic and social responsibilities of artists and culturalists.",""],[1,"104","5","Copyright Protection Enforcement","Adequately implementing copyright protection.",""],[1,"104","5","National Heritage Preservation and Promotion","Preserving and promoting the heritage and cultural values of the nation.",""],[1,"104","5","International Cultural Exchange and Cooperation","Proactively cooperating and promoting international exchanges in culture, promoting Vietnam's culture, selectively adopting the quintessence of world's cultures, preserving the cultural identity of the people.",""],[1,"104","6","Media Development for National Development and Defense","Efficiently and positively developing the press, publishing, radio and television to meet the needs for national development and defense and also the ever-increasing demands of the people.",""]],"24":[[1,"83","4","Information and Communication Services Development","Strongly develop information and communication services to meet the requirements of socio-economic development and to ensure national defense and security.",""],[1,"83","4","E-Government Promotion and Public Service Improvement","Promote e-government, improve the performance of state agencies to serve the people and enterprises better.",""],[1,"83","4","IT Service Hiring Mechanism for Public Administration","Implement mechanism for hiring information technology services in state management and public service delivery.",""]],"25":[[1,"9","4","State-Owned Enterprise Restructuring","Restructure State-owned enterprises striving for efficiency, transparency and on target with clear deadlines and strictly follow the Law on management and utilization of State capital invested in the enterprise's manufacturing and business activities.",""],[1,"9","4","State Capital Management Agency Development","Research for the formulation of an agency for managing State capital and properties in enterprises to cope with new situations.",""],[1,"36","4","State-Owned Enterprise Restructuring and Equitization Policy","Implement the policy of corporate restructuring, policy mechanism of arrangement and equitization of state-owned enterprises in 2011-2015 continued to be finalized towards improving the quality of equitization, prevent loss of capital, state assets, thereby creating a legal environment, which is comprehensive and conducive to be implemented.",""],[1,"84","2","State-Owned Enterprise Ownership Function Separation Reform","focus on directing research to build focused proposals, mechanism and policy to separate capital owners functions, state property and state management functions, business management functions of state enterprises",""],[1,"84","2","Agency for State-Owned Enterprise Ownership Representation","research urgently to form the agency in charge of performing the function of representing the owner of state-owned enterprises and state-owned capital in enterprises",""],[1,"84","2","State-Owned Enterprise Transparency Enhancement","enhance the transparency of information on the activities of state-owned enterprises and state-invested enterprises",""],[1,"84","3","State-Owned Enterprise Restructuring and Equitisation Programme","Implement synchronous measures to restructure state-owned enterprises, improve the efficiency of operations in accordance with market mechanisms, ensure the implementation of the assigned tasks.",""],[1,"84","5","State-Owned Enterprise Priority Investment and Service Provision Mandate","state-owned enterprises are to focus on the following areas: provision of essential public products and services for society; sectors directly serving defense and security; in the field of natural monopolies; high-tech applications, large investment, creating fast growing impetus for the industry, other sectors and the economy.",""],[1,"85","2","State Enterprise Restructuring and Privatization Programme","The ministries, branches and localities, state-owned corporations and companies continue to implement the resolutions of the Party on reorganization, privatization and improving the efficiency of State enterprises9.",""],[1,"85","2","State Enterprise Restructuring Roadmap Dissemination and Enforcement","Continue to thoroughly disseminate to all levels and sectors and state-owned enterprises on the plan, roadmap to restructure, equitisation, state divestments; see it as a key task that needs focused direction to complete according to the approved schemes.",""],[1,"85","2","Administrative Sanctions for Non-Compliance in Enterprise Restructuring","Sanction administratively business leaders who do not seriously implement or implement with no results restructuring, equitisation, state divestments and tasks assigned in the management and administration of the business.",""],[1,"85","3","State-Owned Enterprise Structural Reform and Governance Improvement","Continue to promote structural reform and to improve the quality of governance and efficiency of state-owned enterprises.",""]],"26":[[1,"37","5","Services Sector Development","Has focused on developing the services sector with high potential, advantages and high scientific technological content, such as ICT information, communications, logistics26, aviation, finance, banking, tourism, e-commerce, ...",""],[1,"37","5","National Trade and Services Network Expansion","Trade and services networks thrive on a national scale to better meet the requirements of socio-economic development.",""],[1,"83","2","Service Sector Development Prioritization","Step up the development of the service sectors, striving for average growth rate of 6.6 - 7.1%/year.",""],[1,"83","2","Knowledge- and Technology-Intensive Service Promotion","Prioritize the development of service sectors that have advantages along with high levels of knowledge, technology and added value.",""],[1,"88","5","High-Quality Services Development in the Red River Delta","Prioritizing the development of high quality services according to international standards, in which Hanoi is to become a reputable financial and banking center of the region.",""],[1,"91","1","Service Sector Development for Production and Livelihood","Promoting the development of services in order to meet the demands for production and livelihood of the people.",""],[1,"91","3","Premium Services Sector Development","Regarding the service sector, focusing on the development of premium, high-quality services such as finance, banking, commerce, telecommunications, transportation, science and technology, education, healthcare, tourism, seaports services, ...",""],[1,"91","3","Ho Chi Minh City Regional Services Hub Development","Constructing Ho Chi Minh City into a center for services with quality at regional and international levels.",""]],"27":[[1,"70","2","Knowledge Economy Pillars Development","Focus on developing the four pillars of the knowledge economy: educated and skilled labor force, efficient innovation system, modern information technology and communications infrastructure, updated institutional and economic system.",""],[1,"75","4","Synchronous Science and Technology Market Development","Develop a synchronous science and technology market.",""],[1,"75","4","Commercialization Policy and Mechanism Support","Have appropriate policies and mechanisms to promote the commercialization of scientific and technological exchanges and development.",""],[1,"75","4","Technology Transfer and Intellectual Property Support","Enhance technology transfer, develop technology transfer organizations, connect supply and demand, connect domestic market with the region and the world along with protecting intellectual property.",""],[1,"75","4","National Science and Technology Database System","Develop a national database system for science, technology, form a system of organizations in scientific, technology services.",""],[1,"85","4","National Innovation and Creativity Framework","Build a national innovative and creative framework to enhance business productivity.",""],[1,"85","5","Research and Development and Innovation Support for Firms","Support and promote research and development (R&D) activities and the application of new technology and innovation, especially information technology to increase firm's competitiveness and to effectively integrate into the domestic and international supply chain.",""],[1,"85","5","FDI Technology and Knowledge Transfer Cooperation","Promote in-depth cooperation with FDI, facilitating technology and knowledge transfer.",""],[1,"85","5","Firm Technology Absorption and Production Process Upgrading","Improve firms' capcity to learn and manage new technology, support firms to apply new production procedures and technology.",""],[1,"86","1","Foreign Company R&D Center Establishment Initiative","Encourage the establishment of R&D Centers by foreign companies.",""],[1,"95","6","Technology Upgrading for Productivity and Product Quality","Further applying new technology advances for the sake of heightened labour productivity and quality of products despite the trend of decrease in society's total investments.",""],[1,"100","2","Science and Technology Workforce Development Plan","Planning the development of science and technology workforce in close connection with socio-economic development planning, responding to the demand for the development of the country to 2020 and vision to 2030.",""],[1,"100","4","National Innovation System Development","Enhancing science and technology prowess and establishing national innovation system, utilizing creative capacity of every individual, enterprise and organization.",""],[1,"100","4","Science and Technology Governance Reform","Improving the efficiency of the State's governance on science and technology.",""],[1,"100","4","Research Freedom and Scientific Advisory Support","Promoting democracy, respect and freedom in scientists' researches, advisory and criticism.",""],[1,"100","4","Private Sector Science and Technology Incentives","Promoting and creating favorable conditions for businesses of all economic sectors in researching, developing and implementing science and technology.",""],[1,"100","4","University Research Strengthening Initiative","Strengthening researches in universities.",""],[1,"101","1","Public Science and Technology Organization Self-Governance Support","Continuing to support public science and technology organizations in the implementation of self-governance and self-responsibility mechanisms and helping them in the process of establishing science and technology enterprises.",""],[1,"101","1","Science and Technology Enterprise Linkage and Innovation Partnership","Promoting the linkage between science and technology organizations and enterprises in researching, implementing and innovating technologies and training workforce with enterprises being the core of innovation.",""],[1,"101","1","Public-Private Partnership Mechanism for Science and Technology Development","Implementing PPP mechanism and co- sponsoring science and technology development missions.",""],[1,"101","1","Science and Technology Financing Access Mechanism","Creating conditions for science and technology organizations to borrow from science and technology funds or credit organizations.",""],[1,"101","1","Intellectual Property Valuation and Protection Institution","Establishing the institution for valuing intellectual properties, enhancing intellectual property protection and duly handling violations.",""],[1,"101","1","Technology Import Support and Control Measures","Assisting the import of source technologies, high technologies and strictly controlling the import of technologies.",""],[1,"101","2","Special Mechanism for Science and Technology Institutions and Projects","Establishing special mechanism to develop key science and technology institutions following advanced models and operating important science and technology projects for the sake of socio-economic development, national defense and security.",""],[1,"101","2","Technology Ordering and Output-Based Research Funding Mechanism","Implementing mechanisms of technology ordering, procurement, output-based funding and transparency in research costs and results.",""],[1,"101","2","State-Led Research Mission Assignment System","Gradually changing from a system of regular funding allocation to a system in which the State directly creates technological orders, assigns research missions and allocates the funds needed to complete those missions.",""],[1,"101","2","Competitive Grant Allocation for Science and Technology Proposals","Applying mechanism of fund allotments to science and technology proposals and projects in certain fields of science and technology on the basis of careful evaluation of content, output and cost forecast.",""],[1,"101","2","Transfer of Ownership of State-Funded Research Results","Transferring ownership of State Budget funded science and technology research results to organizations and individuals chairing the researches themselves, and also devising plans to appropriately share benefits between the State, the chairing organizations and the researchers.",""],[1,"101","2","Science and Technology Development Funds and Venture Fund Promotion","Improving the efficiency of funds that focuses on science and technology development and promoting the activities of venture funds in these fields.",""],[1,"101","2","Science and Technology Oversight and Social Monitoring System","Strengthening inspection, monitoring, independent evaluation, consulting, criticism and social monitoring on science and technology activities.",""],[1,"101","3","Science and Technology Investment Mobilization Mechanism","Effectively utilizing State Budget's capital and developing mechanisms and policies to attract non-governmental resources to invest in researching, developing and implementing sciences and technologies.",""],[1,"101","3","Modern Science and Technology Application Institutions","Establishing modern science and technology application institutions, developing innovation centers and technology incubators.",""],[1,"101","3","Science and Technology Infrastructure Upgrading","Developing criteria for the selection of science and technology organizations that have reached the levels of the region and the world in order to focus investment to develop infrastructure, research equipment, ensuring that by 2020, some research fields have had advanced infrastructure and research equipments at region's level.",""],[1,"102","1","Development of Science and Technology Organizations","science and technology organizations following advanced models of the world, first of all the Vietnam - Korea Institute of Science and Technology (V-KIST).",""],[1,"102","1","Science and Technology Enterprise Incubation Support","Promoting the development of science and technology enterprises through promoting the development of technology incubators, incubating science and technology enterprises, developing science and technology enterprises starting from universities and research institutes.",""],[1,"102","1","Supportive Conditions for Science and Technology Institutes","Facilitating favorable conditions for the development of science and technology institutes.",""],[1,"102","1","Science and Technology Human Resource Policy","Establishing policies to train, develop, utilize and honor individuals and organizations working in the fields of science and technology.",""],[1,"108","4","Innovation and Creative Ideas Support","Encouraging and supporting innovating and creative ideas, especially in",""]],"28":[[1,"85","4","Private Sector Enabling Environment Reform","Create an enabling and favorable environment for private sector to thrive and become the driving force of the economy and its competitiveness.",""],[1,"85","4","Private Sector Legal and Policy Reform","Improve existing laws and policies to enable the private sector to have equal acces to opportunities, resources, and most importantly capital including land, natural resources, information, and supportive policies.",""],[1,"85","4","Entrepreneurship Promotion and Startup Support Centers","Promote entrepreneurship, establish guiding centers to help and provide start-ups with knowledge and potential funding from venture capital funds.",""],[1,"95","5","Private Investment Promotion and Enabling Environment Measures","Promoting and creating favourable environments for private investments in the following categories: infrastructure, line industries and products which harbors competitiveness and growth potential, social and environmental fields;",""]],"29":[[1,"9","4","Investment Environment Improvement","Continue to enhance the investment environment aiming for the top 4 of the South-East Asia region.",""],[1,"9","4","Startup Promotion Policy Support","Promote start- ups with policy support from the Government.",""],[1,"61","7","Development Thinking Innovation and Resource Mobilization Reform","have breakthroughs in innovating consistent and synchronous thinking in development with high political determination, put the interests of the country and the people as the highest goal, concentrate in completing the socialist-oriented market economy, and create strong motivations to mobilize, allocate and use effectively every available resources for socio-economic development.",""],[1,"62","3","Business and Investment Environment Reform","Fourth, establish healthy and transparent business and investment environment; mobilize and use effectively all resources, maximize the potential of all people, all economic sectors - especially private sector - regarding them as an important force for economic and social development as well as job creation.",""],[1,"69","3","Competition Law and Enforcement Reform","Continue to innovate in law making and enforcement to ensure fair competition between enterprises in all economic sectors.",""]],"30":[[1,"10","3","Support Industries Development and Industrial Cluster Formation","Focus on the development of support industries, enhance the linkage between multinational corporations and domestic firms; establish supportive industry clusters.",""],[1,"24","5","Mineral Deep Processing and Raw Material Export Restriction","Mining industry has shifted the focus to deep processing, proceeding to restrict exports of unprocessed minerals, give priority to secure needs of raw materials and fuel for production in the country.",""],[1,"24","5","Supporting Industries and High-Tech Industry Development","Supporting industries, high-tech industry has begun to take shape and gradually developed to serve the needs of manufacturing and assembly of other sectors, with aim to further enhance the ratio of products localization.",""],[1,"62","5","Key Sector and Product Development Initiative","Focus on developing some key sectors and products that are highly productive and competitive.",""],[1,"82","3","Industrial Development Strategy Review and Industrial Zone Promotion","Review and supplement industrial development strategy; more reasonable industrial distribution in the whole territory. Promote efficient industrial zones and clusters.",""],[1,"82","3","High-Technology Industrial Development Promotion","Accelerate the development of industries with the high content of science and technology, proportion of national values and added value; have a competitive advantage, participating in production network and global value chains.",""],[1,"82","4","Platform Industries Development Policy","Develop platform industries to meet the needs of the basic means of production in the economy.",""],[1,"82","4","Modern Energy, Metallurgy, Petrochemical, and Chemical Industry Upgrading","Develop energy, metallurgy, petrochemical, chemical industries with modern, environmentally-friendly technology, creating products capable of competing.",""],[1,"82","4","Mechanical Industry and Key Mechanical Products Development","Encourage development of strong mechanical enterprises and key mechanical products.",""],[1,"82","4","Electronic, Information Technology, and Software Industry Development Policies","Have policies to develop the electronic industry, the information technology industry, the software industry.",""],[1,"82","4","Agricultural Support Industry Development","Prioritize development of industries to serve agriculture, especially agro-processing industry, production materials and agricultural machinery.",""],[1,"82","4","Industrial Linkages and Supporting Industrial Parks","Focus on developing industries, strengthen links between multinational corporations and local companies, form supporting industrial parks, link industry clusters on the basis of large- scale projects formed in industrial zones and economic zones.",""],[1,"82","4","Economic Zone and Industrial Park Infrastructure Development","Strengthen planning, promote the construction and development of technical infrastructure and social infrastructure of economic zones, industrial parks, industrial clusters to create space for focused, synchronous development, facilitating investment projects of production and business; at the same time making it easy and convenient for management, monitoring and protecting the environment.",""],[1,"82","6","Construction Industry Modernization and Capacity Upgrade","Develop construction industry to advanced levels.",""],[1,"87","4","Industrial Development and Processing Promotion","Prioritizing the development of the power industry, deep processing of minerals, metallurgy, agricultural and forestry product processing, electronics manufacturing and assembly, construction material production.",""],[1,"88","6","Industrial Development for Competitive and Comparative Advantage","Focusing on the development of industries capable of promoting competitive and comparative advantages, with high volume of domestic content and capable of being involved in the global value chain such as electronics, technology information, telecommunications, mechanical engineering; metallurgy industry, chemical, thermal power; ship bulding and repair; new building materials; pharmaceutical chemistry, food processing industry and textile, leather and footwear industry.",""],[1,"88","6","Supporting Industry and Agro-Processing Development","Also prioritizing the development of supplementary industry, agricultural products and seafood processing.",""],[1,"89","4","Petrochemical Industry Development","Developing the petrochemical industry into an industrial pillar of the region and the entire country.",""],[1,"89","4","Industry Development Linked to Maritime Transport Advantages","Developing industries in connection with advantages in maritime transport.",""],[1,"89","4","Development of Regional Advantage Industries","Enhancing the development of advantageous industries of the region such as: ships building and repairing, mechanical manufacturing, textile, leather and footwear production, cement production, seafood processing, cane sugar production, ...",""],[1,"89","4","Formation of Large Industrial Centers","Forming large industrial centers in the following provinces: Thanh Hoa, Ha Tinh, Quang Nam, Quang Ngai, Binh Dinh, Phu Yen.",""],[1,"90","4","Building Materials Industry Development","Developing the bulding material industry.",""],[1,"90","5","Central Highlands Industrial Development Programme","Promoting the potential and advantages of every province in the Central Highland region, strongly developing industries in order to achieve growth objectives and rapid economic restructuring.",""],[1,"90","5","Agricultural and Forestry Products Processing Development","Prioritizing the development of agricultural and forestry products processing industry, aiming at processing products with advantages in raw materials.",""],[1,"90","5","Bauxite Mining and Alumina Processing Development","Developing mineral mining and processing indutries, in which focusing on bauxite mining and alumina processing, making them one of the major industries of the nation.",""],[1,"90","5","Concentrated Mechanical Industry Development","Developing the concentrated mechanical industry to assist agricultural and forestry products processing industry, mineral mining and processing industry and handicrafts production in the region.",""],[1,"91","3","High-Value Industrial Development and Competitiveness Upgrade","Developing value-added, high technology content industries; continuing to develop and enhance competitiveness in key industries, making breakthrough in the development of key industries in the fields of mechanical engineering, petroleum and petrochemical products, chemical products, electronics industry, high-technology industry, biology, supplementary industry development, clean and power-saving industry.",""],[1,"91","3","High-Technology and Biotechnology Production Promotion","Implementing high technology and biological technology in order to manufacture high-quality products with the aim of maximizing added value and sustainable development in combination with ecotourism ...",""],[1,"92","1","Industrial Decentralization to Provincial Growth Areas","Reducing the concentration of industrial development in Ho Chi Minh City, gradually moving industrial centers to localities with growth potential, especially the provinces of Tay Ninh and Binh Phuoc.",""],[1,"98","3","State-Owned Enterprise Investment Reallocation and Divestment Policy","Focusing on investments in line industries and fields that need to be monitored by the State, promoting privatization and divestments from non-primary line industries, ensuring effective investment, assuming primary role in stabilizing macroeconomic conditions, creating favorable economic conditions in order to assist the development of different economic sectors.",""],[1,"98","4","High-Tech Industrial Investment Promotion","promoting investments in high-tech equipment and applications, developing production of high-value products, such as: electronics, telecommunications, computer science with the aim of moving step-by-step to an industry that produces highly intelligent and high value added products",""],[1,"98","4","Industrial Park and Cluster Investment","investing in industrial parks and clusters",""],[1,"98","4","Agricultural Technology Transfer Support","Promoting private sectors' extensive investments in agricultural and rural developing science establishments, in which transfers of agricultural technology advances are to be prioritized",""],[1,"98","5","High-Quality Foreign Direct Investment Attraction Policy","Not attracting foreign investments at all costs and in all line industries, not approving of projects that utilize obsolete technologies or cause negative impacts on the environment.",""],[1,"98","5","Regional Economic Restructuring-Based Investment Selection","Changing the basis of FID attraction from prioritizing quantity of projects to selecting high-quality, high-technology, environment-friendly projects that output competitive products and fit into the economic restructuring process of each region, line ministry and the entire nation.",""],[1,"98","5","Large-Scale Competitive Investment Attraction and Global Value Chain Integration","Especially focusing on attracting large-scale projects with highly competitive products, joining the global value chains of world-leading multinational corporations and developing a system of supporting line industries and enterprises.",""],[1,"98","5","High-Skilled Workforce Transition for Investment Promotion","Gradually moving away from cheap labor to high quality workforce",""],[1,"99","1","Foreign Investment Attraction Prioritization Framework","Prioritizing on attracting projects that utilize advanced technologies, are environment friendly, projects that efficiently utilize resources, minerals, lands, projects that create favorable conditions for and enhance connection with domestic firms.",""],[1,"99","1","Priority Investment Support for Supporting Industries and Knowledge-Intensive Sectors","Prioritizing investments in supporting industries, agriculture and service- supporting industries with high intellectual content, information technology; science and technology services, education and training; infrastructure development.",""]],"31":[[1,"10","4","Agricultural Restructuring and New Rural Development Programme","Focus on agriculture restructure, improve the efficiency of agricultural production, build new countryside and improve the living standards of the people in the countryside.",""],[1,"10","4","New-Style Cooperatives and Rural Enterprise Investment Support","Encourage household economy, farmstead economy via strong development of new-style cooperatives and attracts enterprises into investing in agriculture, industry and service businesses in countryside area.",""],[1,"34","1","Agricultural Sector Restructuring Scheme","credit institutions, state-owned enterprises and the restructuring of the agricultural sector in connection with building a new countryside.",""],[1,"37","1","Agricultural Restructuring and New Rural Development","Focus on reorganizing production, diversification of crops, livestock according to market demand and develop commodity production areas of large-scale, linking production, processing, preservation and marketing of products associated with the assure of food safety; scaling up production efficiency.",""],[1,"37","1","Agricultural Science and Technology Application","Strengthen the application of science and technology.",""],[1,"37","3","New Rural Development Program Policy Adjustment","Has reviewed and adjusted policies and criteria to be more appropriate to the characteristics of each region and attract more resources and the broad participation of the people.",""],[1,"80","3","Synchronized Sustainable Agricultural Development Measures","Focus on implementation of synchronized, effective solutions for sustainable agricultural development, develop new countryside to improve the material life, spirit of the people; with suitable socio-economic infrastructure.",""],[1,"80","4","Agricultural Restructuring and High-Tech Agriculture Development","Promote agricultural restructuring geared towards developing high-tech, large- cargo agriculture,; strengthen the application of advanced science and technology, improving quality, effective and competitiveness; ensure sustainable development, national food security; work aggressively in food safety and improve the quality of agricultural, forestry and fisheries products.",""],[1,"80","5","Agricultural Value-Addition and Export Competitiveness Development","Take the advantages of tropical agriculture, focus on developing products with comparative advantages, high added value and meet the required standards for export, have the ability to participate effectively in the global value chain.",""],[1,"80","5","Land Consolidation and Efficient Agricultural Land Use Measures","Create favorable conditions for the accumulation of land and more efficient agricultural land use.",""],[1,"80","5","Flexible Protection and Use of Rice Land","Protect and use flexibly, effectively rice land.",""],[1,"80","5","Large-Scale Agricultural Production Area Development","Encourage accumulation, concentration of land, develop large-scale production areas with diverse forms,",""],[1,"81","2","Agricultural Value Chain Linkage and Cooperation Development","Reorganize production, strengthen linkages along the value chain.",""],[1,"81","2","Farmer Credit and Innovation Linkage Support","Encourage linking between producing farmers and credit organizations, scientific, technology institutions, and enterprises.",""],[1,"81","3","Science and Technology Application Support in Agriculture","Have mechanisms and policies to encourage research and application of science and technology, especially biotechnology, information technology in production, management and agricultural extension services.",""],[1,"81","3","Agricultural Product Branding and Technology Support for Farmers","Support enterprises to develop products branding, farmers applying advanced science and technology in agricultural production.",""],[1,"90","4","Central Highland Agricultural Restructuring and Agro-Processing Development","Changing the structure of agriculture so that until 2020, the Central Highland regions basically possesses a large-scale commodity agriculture with focus, high competitiveness, effectiveness and sustainability in connection with the processing industry; also implementing high technology and bio-technology in agricultural and forestry production in order to improve productivity and quality of the products; building brands for some products with comparative advantages of the region such as coffee, rubber, cocoa, pepper, ... strengthening protection of national parks and natural reserves.",""],[1,"91","3","Modernized Sustainable Agriculture Development","Comprehensively and sustainably developing agriculture with the aim of large-scale production, with modern organization and technology, in order to produce diversified, safe and high-quality products for the urban areas, supply materials for the processing industry and for exports.",""],[1,"92","5","Agricultural and Seafood Processing Export Development","Developing the agricultural product and seafood processing industry for exports, mechanical industry for agriculture, off-shore fishing ship building and repair.",""],[1,"92","6","Specialized Agricultural Production and Aquaculture Zone Development","areas for agricultural, forestry and aquacultural cultivation; forming areas for specialized agricultural production such as rice, fruits and vegetables, high-technology agricultural zones, urban agriculture, concentrated aquaculture areas; areas for conservation of biological diversity and natural landscapes, unique",""],[1,"93","2","High-Technology and Specialized Agricultural Spatial Planning","organizing space for agricultural production following models of high-technology agriculture, urban agriculture, specialized agriculture and aquaculture.",""]],"32":[[1,"70","3","Synchronized Infrastructure Systems Development","Promote the implementation of strategies on building synchronized infrastructure systems, with some modern works, focusing investment resources on building major transportation systems and urban infrastructures, prioritizing projects that have widespread effects, form a suitable transport system between transport modes; ensure the connection of transport modes, large economic centers; improve the quality of infrastructure sector planning; construction of highways, urban transport, especially large-volumed transportation; building several modern seaports, airports.",""],[1,"83","3","Integrated Transport Development and Multimodal Logistics Promotion","Develop transportation with logical, effective structure.",""],[1,"93","3","Transport Connectivity Development","Developing transportation in line with the national and Greater Mekong transportation development strategies, ensuring connectivity between the Mekong Delta urban system and Ho Chi Minh City and the Trans-Asia transportation system within the Greater Mekong Delata region.",""],[1,"93","7","Strategic Infrastructure Investment and Connectivity Upgrade Programme","Focusing investment resources to construct large, important and essential projects, especially in areas with growth potential and to resolve bottlenecks and overload.",""],[1,"93","7","National Transport Connectivity Enhancement Programme","Ensuring seamless connectivity between large economic centers, transportation hub gateways and routes with large transportation demands.",""],[1,"93","7","Expressway System Expansion Programme","Continuing to invest in the expressway system, prioritizing investments on the North - South expressway and expressways that connect between large economic centers and seaports.",""],[1,"93","7","Railway Route Upgrading Programme","Upgrading the existing railway routes, raising the size of the tracks from 1m to 1,435m; establishing the necessary conditions to gradually",""],[1,"94","1","North-South High-Speed Railway Construction","construct the North-South high-speed railway.",""],[1,"94","1","International Gateway and Transit Port Development","Completing the construction of international gateway seaports in the North and South areas, also mobilizing other capital sources to construct international transit ports.",""],[1,"94","1","Airport Renovation and Long Thanh Airport Phased Investment","Renovating and upgrading airports; dividing investment phases for the construction process of Long Thanh International Airport.",""],[1,"94","1","Urban Railway System Completion in Major Cities","Completing urban railway systems in Ha Noi and Ho Chi Minh City",""]],"33":[[1,"11","1","Urban Traffic Congestion Reduction Measures","Resolve traffic jams in Ha Noi and Ho Chi Minh City.",""],[1,"11","1","Toll Station Review and Reorganization","Review and rearrange toll stations appropriately in order to relieve the burden for the people and businesses.",""],[1,"11","1","Long Thanh International Airport Phase One Construction","Ensure the first phase of the Long Thanh international airport construction is started and finished on time as stated in Resolution no. 94/2015/QH13 dated June 25th, 2015 of the National Assembly.",""]],"34":[[1,"16","3","Free Trade Agreement Negotiation and Implementation Program","Effectively implement international commitments, actively negotiate and sign new generation Free trade agreements, take full advantages of the chances, and mitigate negative impacts to broaden our markets, and make use of external forces for development.",""],[1,"16","3","2030 Agenda Implementation Plan","Proceed with proper procedures to submit for National Assembly's approval and formulate detailed action program to implement new agreements and the Implementation plan of 17 goals and 169 targets as stated in the \"Transforming our world: The 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development\" of the United Nations.",""],[1,"16","3","Trade Defense Early Warning System","Practice early warning about commercial defensive measures of partner countries.",""],[1,"46","3","Trade Agreement Implementation and FTA Negotiation","Vietnam has actively implemented the signed trade aggrements as well as negotiated and participated in new-generationfree trade aggrements to expand and diversify its good and service markets, promote its economic development and improve its autonomy.",""],[1,"46","3","Accelerated Free Trade Agreement Negotiations","Vietnam has actively speeded up negotiations of FTA that meets pre-set requirements, e.g. Vietnam signed FTA with South Korea, FTA with Europe -Asia Economic Union, the Trans-Pacific Partnership (TPP) and has basically concluded the negotiations for the FTA with EU.",""],[1,"47","2","Strengthening International Integration Institutions","Organization, appartus and institutions for international integration continue to be strengthened.",""],[1,"62","5","Economic Independence and International Integration Enhancement","Sixth, enhance the independence and autonomy of the economy to create a premise for extensive international integration.",""],[1,"62","5","Proactive International Integration Strategy","Proactively integrate in international arena, take advantage of external forces to develop internal force, accelerate economic development and raise the position of our country's economy in the region and the world.",""],[1,"65","4","International Integration and FTA Implementation","Vietnam's international integration process will continue be implemented strongly and comprehensively.",""]],"35":[[1,"73","5","Liberalization of Factor Markets","Gradually implement liberalization of factors of production markets in accordance with market principles.",""],[1,"75","2","Real Estate Market Legal and Policy Reform","Improve the law, policy mechanisms and appropriate measures to create favorable conditions for sustainable development of the real estate market, ensuring smooth operation and efficiency.",""],[1,"75","2","Land Use Rights Market Development","Strongly develop land use rights market, including primary market and secondary market, especially for agricultural land to encourage accumulation, concentration of land.",""],[1,"75","2","Constitutional Land Law Institutionalization","Fully institutionalize the contents and spirit of relevant provisions in the Constitution.",""],[1,"75","2","Public Land Use Planning Process","Promulgate and implement of the process of land use planning publicly and transparently, with the participation of individuals, families and organizations affected by the plan.",""],[1,"75","2","Land Allocation and Auction Reform","Remove land allocation mechanism, administrative land lease mechanism, develop the primary market of land use rights by public auction and bidding of land use rights, bidding to seek investors to use land.",""]],"36":[[1,"10","1","Maritime Economy Development Programme","Strengthen the development of maritime economy, protect our maritime sovereignty and improve the living standard of people living on islands.",""],[1,"38","2","Ocean Strategy Implementation","Has focused to implement Ocean Strategy.",""],[1,"38","2","Marine Economy Development Investment","Has developed and invested in marine economy, especially the oil and gas exploration, shipping, ports, building and repairing of ships, marine tourism, aquaculture; developed logistics service and promoted offshore fishing.",""],[1,"38","2","Fisheries Sector Development Decree No. 67/2014/ND-CP","Decree No. 67/2014/ND-CP has been enacted with the objective of developing the fisheries sector as an important economic sector, which has potential to be combined with protecting maritime sovereignty.",""],[1,"38","2","Fisheries Infrastructure and Services Support","Along with increased investment in infrastructure construction and fisheries services, has supported funding for the building of new fishing facilities.",""],[1,"84","1","Marine Economy Development and Coastal Infrastructure Programme","Strongly develop marine economies tied to firmly safeguarding national sovereignty and improving people's living standards on the seas and islands.",""],[1,"84","1","Private Sector Investment Promotion in Marine Industries","Encourage all economic sectors to invest in developing the extraction and processing of oil and gas; ports, building and repair of ships, maritime transport; fishing and seafood processing, fishing logistics services; maritime, island tourism.",""],[1,"84","1","Coastal Economic Zone and Industrial Park Development","Develop economic zones, industrial parks and export processing zones associated with the development of coastal urban areas along the coast.",""],[1,"84","1","Marine and Island Socio-Economic Infrastructure Development","Develop socio-economic infrastructure to serve production and life on the seas, islands.",""],[1,"84","1","Marine Science, Technology, and International Cooperation Initiative","Strengthen research and application of science and technology, promoting international cooperation in exploiting effectively and sustainably marine resources.",""],[1,"84","1","Fisheries Logistics and Offshore Support Facilities","Develop fisheries logistics facilities, storm shelters, support offshore and long-term fishing operations at sea.",""],[1,"89","7","Specialty High-Quality Seafood Cultivation Development","Focusing on the development of specialty, high quality seafood cultivation (lobsters, seahorses, mollusks, ... ) suitable to the natural conditions of the region.",""],[1,"89","7","Offshore Fishing Fleet Modernization","Upgrading high capacity fishing fleets with information system equipment, GPS and modern fishing and freezing equipment to improve off-shore fishing capability and at",""],[1,"90","1","Maritime Logistics Support for Sea Trawlers","Organizing logistical services (water, ice and oil supply, ship maintenance and repair, ... ) to serve sea trawlers in long fishing trips.",""]],"37":[[1,"81","2","Agricultural and Rural Development Civil Society Engagement","Promote the role of the Fatherland Front, socio- political organizations, particularly the Farmers Association and industry associations in agriculture and rural development.",""],[1,"86","2","Cooperative Economy Development and Scaling Programme","Encourage the sustainable development of cooperative economy, of which the core is cooperatives with many forms of association and diversity; replicate and scale-up successful cooperative models; facilitate the growth of family businesses in agriculture, industry, and services; contribute to the value chain from production to consumption, ensuring the harmony of interests of different stakeholders.",""],[1,"86","2","Cooperative Law Dissemination and Public Education","Continue to focus on disseminating and educating the public about cooperative laws.",""],[1,"86","2","Preferential Policy Support for Cooperatives","Continue to improve and further implement preferential policies, support the development of cooperative according to the local needs, appropriate capability and resources of the government.",""],[1,"86","2","Cooperative Manager Training and Governance Strengthening","In particular, focus on policy implementation and human resources training for managers of cooperatives; preferential policies to support cooperatives in agricultural sector, rural areas, and disadvantaged areas.",""],[1,"86","2","Collective Economy Institutional Strengthening","Strengthen and improve the efficiency of public management in cooperatives, especially within the leadership, local party committees, and all levels of government in the development of cooperatives.",""],[1,"86","2","National Collective Economy Expansion Initiative","Research, develop, and expand the collective economic model throughout the country, especially in key economic regions.",""],[1,"86","2","Pilot Cooperative Formation and Expansion Support","Focus on appropriating resources to support the formation and expansion of pilot cooperatives.",""],[1,"86","2","International Cooperative Partnership Promotion","Encourage international participation and partnership in developing effective cooperatives, especially in learning from successful experience of cooperatives in other countries.",""],[1,"86","2","Collective Economy State Management Reform","Improve the efficiency of state management of collective economy.",""],[1,"86","2","Cooperative Alliance and Mass Organization Engagement","Strengthen the role, responsibilities, and effectiveness of Cooperative Alliance of Vietnam and promote the role of Fatherland Front, mass organizations, associations, and unions in the development of collective economy.",""]],"38":[[1,"67","2","Institutional Reform for a Socialist-Oriented Market Economy","Focus on perfecting the institutions for a socialist- oriented market economy.",""],[1,"73","1","Market Economy Institution Improvement and Market Development","Perfect the market economy institutions, synchronous development of assorted markets, create a favorable environment for investment, business",""],[1,"73","2","Market Economy Institutional Reform","Focus on perfecting the market economy institutions on the basis of synchronization, modern and fully complying with the rules of the market economy and deep international economic integration.",""]],"39":[[1,"16","1","Foreign Relations Effectiveness and International Integration Initiative","Improve the effectiveness of foreign relation activities, proactively integrate into the globe, and create a peaceful environment and favourable conditions for national development",""],[1,"16","2","Strengthen International Partnerships and Foreign Relations","Bring more depth, practicality, and effectiveness to our partnerships.",""],[1,"16","2","Enhance Bilateral Foreign Relations","Enhance the effectiveness of inter-lateral foreign relations.",""],[1,"16","2","ASEAN and United Nations Cooperation for Sovereignty Protection","Closely cooperate with ASEAN nations and agencies of the United Nations to protect our sovereignty and territorial integrity.",""],[1,"16","2","Peaceful Maritime Dispute Resolution","Persistently solving maritime disputes by peaceful measures, based on international law and the region's code of conduct.",""],[1,"16","4","Foreign Relations Information and International Integration Support","Strengthen the effort in foreign relation information, international integration, generate domestic approval and make use of international support for the development and protection of our nation.",""],[1,"46","3","Strategic Cooperation and Multilateral Diplomacy Expansion","Vietnam has enhanced strategic cooperation and dialogue with multiple partners; upgradedsome bilateral relationsto strategic and comprehensive partnerships; our partnerships become more in-depth,substantive and more effective.",""],[1,"46","3","ASEAN and International Organization Engagement","Vietnam has actively and responsibly participated in international organizations and forums, especially in the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) and the United Nations (UN).",""],[1,"46","3","APEC Summit Hosting","Next, Vietnam is going to host the APEC Summit in 2017.",""],[1,"46","3","East Sea DOC Compliance and COC Development","Regarding the East Sea, Vietnam and ASEAN have persistently advocate for full compliance of The Declaration on the Conduct of Parties in the East Sea (DOC) and are looking towards building the Code of Conduct in the East Sea (COC).",""],[1,"111","1","Participation in United Nations Peacekeeping Operations","Participating in peacekeeping operations of the United Nation in a manner that is suitable to the conditions of Vietnam.",""],[1,"111","3","Foreign Policy Diversification and International Cooperation","Consistently implementing foreign policies in an independent, autonomous, peaceful, friendly, cooperation-for-development manner; multi-lateralizing and diversifying foreign relations, actively and positively integrating and cooperating internationally on the basis of respecting independence, sovereignty, territorial integrity and non-interference in each other's internal affairs, fairness and mutual benefits.",""],[1,"111","3","Strengthening Multilateral Diplomacy","Improving the efficiency of multilateral diplomatic activities, especially with ASEAN and the United Nation.",""],[1,"111","3","ASEAN Community Building Participation","Actively, positively, and responsibly participating in the construction of a robust ASEAN community with other ASEAN nations.",""],[1,"111","3","International Defense and Security Cooperation","Strengthening international and regional cooperation in national defense and security and protecting national sovereignty.",""],[1,"111","3","Peaceful Maritime Dispute Resolution","Persistently promoting peaceful solutions to the problem of maritime disputes, on the basis of international laws and regional code of conduct.",""],[1,"111","4","Integrated Foreign Affairs Implementation","Synchronously implementing foreign affair activities, including activities in the fields of politics, national defense and security, economy, culture and society.",""],[1,"111","4","Implementation of International Commitments","Effectively implementing international commitments",""],[1,"111","4","International Investment and Commercial Dispute Resolution Capacity Building","Improving the capacity in resolving international investment and commercial disputes.",""],[1,"111","5","Foreign Affairs Advisory and International Integration Strengthening","Improving the quality of advising in the matters of foreign affairs and international integration.",""],[1,"111","5","Foreign Communication and National Consensus Building","Strengthening foreign communication and international integration, building national consensus and utilizing the support of international friends to meet the demand for nation building and defending.",""],[1,"112","1","Overseas Vietnamese Engagement and Citizen Protection Policy","Strengthening the activities of Vietnamese people abroad.",""]],"40":[[1,"15","1","Justice System Integrity and Human Rights Protection","Enhance the operation of the justice system, mitigate injustice, forced perjury and torture in investigation, prosecution and trial to ensure human and civil rights.",""],[1,"27","6","Legal System Improvement and Constitutional Implementation","The legal system has been improved continuously, in order to meet the requirements of development and international integration; the Constitution of 2013 has been promulgated and implemented.",""]],"41":[[1,"14","4","Civil Service Monitoring, Evaluation, and Accountability Reform","Monitor the law and regulation implementation, state officials and civil servants evaluation, stamp out staffs who hinder, take advantages of or raise difficulty against business and people.",""],[1,"14","4","Civil Service Recruitment and Appointment Reform","Revitalize the recruitment, sacking, discharge, promotion and appointment of state officials and civil servants to ensure legality, democracy, equality and transparency.",""],[1,"108","2","State Apparatus Streamlining and Administrative Reform","Organizing the State's apparatus in a strong, streamlined and transparent manner.",""],[1,"108","3","State-Market Role Clarification and Regulatory Governance Reform","Establishing a clear distinction between the roles of the State and the market.",""],[1,"108","4","Legal System Improvement and State Agency Function Clarification","Improving the legal system, ensuring coherence, consistency, publicity and transparency, responding to the needs for socio-economic development and international integration.",""],[1,"109","1","State Administrative Accountability and Decision Transparency Mechanism","establishing and strictly implementing mechanisms of accountability of State administrative agencies, creating transparency in the process of making decisions and boosting the confidence of the people in the leadership direction and policies of the Party and the State.",""],[1,"109","2","Public Administration Modernization and Civil Service Reform","Establishing modern, professional, disciplined, dynamic and effective public administration, making service outcomes and the level of satisfaction of the people and businesses evaluation criterion.",""],[1,"109","2","Public Sector Transparency and Accountability Enhancement","Enhancing publicity and transparency and accountability.",""],[1,"109","2","Cadre and Civil Servant Capacity and Ethics Development","Focusing on cultivating cadres and civil servants with moral qualities, work capabilities, sense of responsibilities and professionalism.",""],[1,"109","2","Civil Service Downsizing and Wage Reform","Downsizing personnel along with wage reform.",""],[1,"109","2","Recruitment and Promotion Process Reform","Innovating processes of recruitment and promotion for cadres and public servants, ensuring competition, publicity and transparency.",""],[1,"109","2","Performance-Based Civil Service Evaluation System","Evaluating cadres and public servants on the basis of work performance.",""],[1,"109","2","Agency Head Accountability and Delegated Authority Reform","The heads of government agencies are to be responsible for the performance of the work assigned to them and equally authorized to decide on matters of organization and personnel.",""],[1,"109","2","Sanctions for Violations by Public Officials","Establishing adequate sanctions to handle officials violating the laws, especially officials in charge of leadership and management.",""]],"42":[[1,"14","3","Anti-Corruption Enforcement and Monitoring Mechanism","Strengthen the anti-corruption apparatus.",""],[1,"45","2","Anti-Corruption and Anti-Wastefulness Institutional Strengthening","Institutions for anti-corruption and anti-wastefulness are continued to improve.",""],[1,"45","2","Corruption Case Investigation, Prosecution, and Trial Processing","Concentrate on directing, supervising, inspecting, examining, handling and publicizing corruption cases.",""],[1,"45","2","Anti-Wastefulness and Savings Measures","Besides, many anti-wastefulness and saving solutions have been implemented.",""],[1,"45","2","Citizen Complaint Reception and Resolution Improvement","Moreover, citizen reception and settlement of complaints and denunciations have been improved.",""],[1,"45","2","Backlog Case Reduction and Complaint Management","Also, elevated complaints have been limited and a large number of backlog cases are handled.",""],[1,"107","3","Anti-Corruption Institutions and Enforcement Strengthening","Continuing to improve institutions, mechanisms and policies, ensuring coherence, publicity, transparency and synchronous implementation of measures in preventing and combatting corruption, practicing thrift, focusing on areas where negative behaviors are likely to happen.",""],[1,"107","3","Anti-Corruption Organizational Capacity Improvement","Strengthening the organizational structure, improving the efficiency of the anti-corruption system.",""],[1,"107","3","Asset and Income Declaration Compliance","Strictly implementing the regulations regarding the declaration of property ownership and income of government officers and public servants, especially leading cadres; limiting cash transactions.",""],[1,"107","3","Public Ethics and Service Responsibility Education","Focusing on the education of moral qualities and public service responsibilities.",""],[1,"107","3","Anti-Corruption Accountability Clarification for Party and Agency Heads","Enhancing and specifying the responsibilities of party organizations and the head of the organizations, agencies and units in preventing and combatting corruption and wasteful behavior.",""],[1,"107","4","Anti-Corruption Oversight and Enforcement Strengthening","Improving the validity and efficiency of inspecting, auditing, investigating, prosecuting and trying activities.",""],[1,"108","1","Whistleblower Protection and Anti-Corruption Complaint Handling Mechanism","Properly receiving information and handling complaints and denunciations.",""],[1,"108","1","Whistleblower Safety Incentives and Protection Measures","Establishing effective mechanisms and policies to encourage, reward and protect the safety of whistleblowers.",""],[1,"108","1","Anti-Corruption Public Education and Media Engagement","Promoting education, the role and responsibilities of information communication agencies in preventing and combatting corruption and wasteful behavior.",""],[1,"108","1","Sanctions Against Abuse of Anti-Corruption Activities","Strictly handling abuse of anti-corruption activities for the purpose of slandering and distorting the truth.",""],[1,"108","1","International Anti-Corruption Cooperation","Enhancing international cooperation in preventing and combatting corruption.",""]],"43":[[1,"17","1","Civil Society Mobilization and Supervision for Resolution Implementation","The Vietnam Fatherland Front, Front member organizations and social organizations established under law shall supervise and mobilize the people of all strata to join in the fruitful implementation of the Resolution of the National Assembly.",""],[1,"62","6","Timely Dissemination of Accurate Public Information","Seventh, improve the timely dissemination and propagation of accurate information according to the orientation of the Party and the State.",""],[1,"67","4","Democratic Rights Promotion and Enforcement Mechanism","Vigorously promote the democratic rights of the people in perfecting and enforcing mechanisms and policies of socio-economic development.",""]],"44":[[1,"83","7","Tourism Sector Development Policy","Have policies to develop tourism into a spearhead economic sector.",""],[1,"83","7","Tourism Investment and Infrastructure Mobilization","Encourage all economic sectors to invest in development of tourism with synchronized, modern infrastructure system, diversified products and high professionalism.",""],[1,"83","7","Tourism Facilitation and Safety Measures","Create favorable conditions for entry, exit and travel procedures, and ensure safety and security.",""],[1,"83","7","Vietnam Tourism Branding and Promotion","Promote, advertise, develop branding of Vietnam tourism.",""],[1,"83","7","Sustainable Tourism Heritage Management","Exploit effectively and sustainably cultural, natural, historic, scenic heritage, and maintain environmental hygiene.",""],[1,"83","7","Large-Scale Tourism Service Complex Development","Develop tourism service complexes, with large scale and high quality.",""],[1,"88","5","Regional Tourism Development Initiative","Developing tourism to into a spearhead economic sector of the region.",""],[1,"89","5","Service Sector Development and Tourism Promotion","Developing the service sectors such as seaports, aviation, finance and banking, telecommunications, emphasizing the development of tourism and making it into a spearhead economic sector, ... Promoting the development of various forms of advantageous marine tourism, including: marine and island resorts, sightseeing, hiking, ecotourism in national parks, nature conservation areas, natural and cultural heritage sites.",""],[1,"91","1","Tourism Product Diversification and Premium Resort Development","Diversifying types of tourism products on the basis of utilizing the strengths and potential of the region in natural resources, history, traditional ethnic minority culture, effectively utilizing the special climate conditions of the region to establish and promote premium tourism and resorts in Da Lat City (Lam Dong province), Mang Den Town (Kon Tum province), ...",""],[1,"92","6","Spatial Reorientation of Economic Zones and Tourism Development","Adjusting the orientation for the distribution of concentrated economic zones in connection with urban areas and also national and regional urban economic corridors, ensuring effective utilization of advantages in raw materials, human resources; ecotourism sites; forming tourism centres of national and international levels, regional level tourism clusters, local tours, national and international tours, landscape-related tourism products, cultural and historic tourism, resort tourism;",""]],"45":[[1,"79","5","Export Promotion and Market Diversification","Promote export, control imports accordingly.",""],[1,"79","6","Export Restructuring and Value-Added Promotion","Develop exports with the growth model of sustainable and reasonable balance between breadth and depth, both expanding the scale of exports, and focusing on improving exports' value-added.",""],[1,"79","6","Strategic Import of Machinery and High Technology","Import machines, equipment and high technology in line with the resources, the level of domestic production, saving energy and supplies; stable import orientation for industries that use raw materials, fuel, materials that domestic exploitation and production are inefficient or have an adverse impact on the environment.",""],[1,"80","1","Trade Promotion and Export Competitiveness Measures","Strengthen trade promotion, improve product quality, branding of Vietnam goods, especially commodities that have advantages.",""],[1,"80","1","Export Expansion Through Trade Agreements","Make the most of favorable conditions in trade agreements, deals to boost exports; concurrently have appropriate defensive measures to protect producers and consumers interests.",""],[1,"80","1","Import Control and Sustainable Trade Balance Measures","Strive to achieve exports growth rate on average of about 10%/year, appropriate import controls and strive for sustainable trade balance.",""],[1,"111","4","New Generation Free Trade Agreement Negotiation","actively and positively negotiating and concluding new generation's Free Trade Agreements",""],[1,"111","4","Market Expansion and External Resource Mobilization","maximizing the potential of favorable opportunities and minimizing the negative impacts to expand the market and utilize external resources for development.",""]],"46":[[1,"12","5","Non-Public Health Care and Hospital Partnership Reform","Continue the development of non-public health care services, pilot private-public partnership for health care institutions and public enterprise management model for hospitals.",""],[1,"12","5","Domestic Medicine Development and Quality Management","Create policies to encourage the development and application of domestic medicine and enhance the quality of traditional medical science.",""],[1,"12","5","Domestic Medicine Industry Support and Quality Regulation","Support the development of domestic medicine industry, improve the management of medicine quality, and enhance the effectiveness of medicine bidding.",""],[1,"40","3","Private Health, Traditional Medicine, and Pharmaceutical Sector Development","The private health facilities, traditional medicine and the pharmaceutical industry were encouraged to develop.",""],[1,"40","3","Quality Management and Medicine Price Regulation","Strengthen quality management and medicine prices.",""],[1,"41","2","Integration of Traditional and Modern Medicine","Combine of traditional medicine with modern medicine in disease prevention, healthcare, scientific research has changed;",""],[1,"41","2","Domestic Vaccine Production Expansion","Production of vaccines in the country has met the 10/11 vaccines used in the expanded vaccination program countries.",""],[1,"41","2","Drug Price Management and Procurement Reform","Enhancement of drug price management and procurement for innovation in drug helped reduce medical costs, which facilitates the development of the pharmaceutical industry.",""],[1,"41","3","Non-Public Health Service Development","Some areas of socialization activities were promoted; non-public health developed rapidly in recent years, the country has 171 operating private hospitals with around 690 beds, accounting for 11% of all hospitals in the country, including more than 30,000 clinics public and private health service facilities.",""]],"47":[[1,"13","3","Gender Equality and Women’s Advancement Policy Implementation","Effectively implement gender equality policy and women advancement policy.",""]],"48":[[1,"28","3","Business Environment and Administrative Procedure Reform","Particularly is the implementation of Resolution No. 19/NQ-CP dated March 18, 2014 and Resolution No. 19/NQ-CP dated March 12, 2015, promoting the reform and simplification of administrative procedures, facilitating, reducing the time, costs for business, improving investment, business environment, and promoting competitiveness16, especially in the areas directly relevant to citizens and enterprises; building business environment to be more transparent17; such as: reducing processing time for business registration documents, legalizing processes of business registration information exchange, information about financial statements of the business between the business registration agencies and tax authorities, unifying processes to share information about the status of the business activities in order to raise the effectiveness and efficiency of the state administration, for enterprises established after registration.",""],[1,"28","3","Review and Elimination of Conditional Investment Business Lines","Review and eliminate lines of conditional investment business18; public list ofbusiness",""],[1,"29","1","Business Registration Portal Administrative Procedure Reform","investment fields with conditions and detailed instructions on administrative regulations for each field on the National Portal of business registration;",""],[1,"29","1","Tax Declaration and Payment Procedure Simplification","reform processes, records and tax payment procedures in order to shorten the time to declare and pay tax for enterprises which reach the average time of ASEAN 6 countries in 2015;",""],[1,"29","1","Customs Management Process Reform for Foreign Traders","study to issue customs management processes for processing goods for foreign traders, regulations on customs supervision at seaports ...",""],[1,"29","1","Electronic Tax Payment and Filing Automation","extend tax payment via bank system, boost the automation process of receiving settlement records, tax administrative procedures, encourage enterprises to implement the tax declaration via the Internet ...",""]],"49":[[1,"67","4","Institutional Mechanism and Policy Reform for Rule of Law Governance","Focus on building institutional mechanisms, policies and environment, conditions to be more transparent, safe and convenient for the people, enterprises free to innovate, invest, conduct business and competition fairly in the market economy.",""]],"50":[[1,"76","1","Public Services Market Development","Promote the development of public services markets.",""],[1,"76","2","Public Service Legal and Classification Reform","Complete the legal framework, the classification of public service in the direction based on the criticality of the service rather than based on the type of service providers.",""],[1,"76","2","Public Career Unit Restructuring and Autonomy Reform","Restructuring of public career units, appropriate autonomy, capacity management, operational efficiency according to business mechanisms.",""],[1,"76","2","Direct Beneficiary Support and Procurement-Based Service Delivery","Move from allocation mechanism to ordering, procurement service providers and funding from the supplying units to direct support for the beneficiaries.",""],[1,"76","3","Public Service Pricing Transparency and Cost-Recovery Reform","For essential goods, public services, including health, education services of which the State is controlling prices, must ensure openness and transparency of price formation factors; must correctly and fully implement the cost and market value according to the appropriate roadmap.",""],[1,"76","3","Public-Private Partnership Expansion for Public Services","Encourage enterprises of all economic sectors to get involved in the provision of public services, especially in the forms of public-private partnership.",""],[1,"76","3","Support Mechanisms for Non-Public Public Service Providers","Ensure equality between public and non-public career units, have support mechanisms for non-public entities supplying essential public services products.",""],[1,"76","3","Socialization and Equitization of Public Service Units","Diversify forms of socialization of career units such as equitization, community management, leasing facilities, property of the State to provide public services and implement the mechanism in which public career units operate as enterprises that supply public services.",""],[1,"76","3","Corporate Governance Reform for Public Service Units","Equitize some public career units, apply the model of corporate governance in public career units.",""],[1,"76","3","Transparency and Civil Society Oversight Mechanism for Public Services","Create mechanisms to encourage transparency and social organizations and socio-professional organizations to be involved in the inspection and supervision of the provision of public career services.",""],[1,"76","3","User Feedback Mechanism for Public Service Quality Improvement","Establish a mechanism for useful feedback so that the supply base can diversify services and improve service quality.",""]],"51":[[1,"11","3","Universal Education Programme Renovation","Continue to renovate the universal education programme in order to reduce workload for the students; promote independence thinking, creativity and self-research skills in university education.",""],[1,"11","3","Assessment and Examination Reform","Renovate the form, the content of tests, examinations and education result evaluation.",""],[1,"11","3","Public and Non-Public Education Equality Policy","Properly develop and ensure equality between public and non-public education.",""],[1,"11","3","Gifted Student Identification and Support Policy","Create specialized policies to select and provide proper treatment for the gifted.",""],[1,"29","5","Education and Training Network Expansion","Education and training network has been expanded with upscale size and higher quality, which better meets the needs of society.",""],[1,"29","5","Renewal of Education Content, Methods, Examinations, and Accreditation","The contents and methods of education and training, examinations and accreditation have been renewed.",""],[1,"29","7","Preschool Education Expansion and School Standardization","Preschool education in cities and provinces has been concerned to allocate land and new construction investment to meet the requirements of increased scale and quality; priorities are for implementation of public 5-year-old preschool education and up-to-national-standard schools establishment.",""]],"52":[[1,"12","5","Population Management and Family Planning Programme","Give more attention to population management, family planning, maternal and children health care, balance the gender percentage of new-born children, maintain the replacement level fertility, and sustainably develop the population.",""]],"53":[[1,"70","3","Urban Environmental Infrastructure and Wastewater Treatment","Develop infrastructure systems of major urban centers; treatment of wastewater, solid waste, emissions, ...",""],[1,"92","5","Urban Network Distribution and Classification Plan","Adjusting the orientation for the distribution of the urban network, in which: Can Tho city is to be the dynamic and core urban area for the development of the region, along with sub-regional central urban areas and the urban system along the urban economic corridors.",""],[1,"92","5","Regional Urban Area Identification and Classification","Identifying the characteristics, scales and functions of regional and sub-regional level urban areas and also classifying urban areas.",""],[1,"92","5","Concentrated Rural Residential Area Development","Orientating the development of concentrated rural residential areas suitable to the natural and production characteristics of those areas and also following the new rural development model.",""],[1,"94","1","Urban Water Supply and Irrigation Projects","and also water supply and irrigation projects in large urban areas.",""],[1,"94","3","Urban Infrastructure and Planning Improvement","Gradually establishing urban systems with coherent, modern, green and environment-friendly infrastructure, especially in large urban areas.",""],[1,"94","3","Urban Planning Quality and Land Use Management Reform","Improving the quality and management of urban planning, ensuring sustainable development, establishing policies for the construction of new urban areas along large urban areas, effectively utilizing infrastructure and saving lands.",""],[1,"94","3","Urban Transport Service Improvement","Improving the quality of urban transportation services.",""],[1,"94","3","Affordable Housing Support for Low-Income Workers","Encouraging the development of housings for low-income people and people working in industrial zones, also encouraging enterprises' owners to build housings to be rented out to workers.",""]],"54":[[1,"10","4","Rural Training and Labour Transition Programme","Encourage training in various forms, which suits and boosts economic growth, generates jobs, increases income and changes the countryside economic and employment structure; show significant changes from labour transition to high value-added sectors in 2016 and 2017.",""],[1,"12","2","Employment and Unemployment Security Policy","Implement employment policy and unemployment security.",""],[1,"75","3","Labor Market Development and Worker Mobility Reform","Develop the labor market, ensure synchronous interconnection, transparency, facilitate the free movement of workers to increase labor productivity.",""],[1,"75","3","Decoupling Household Registration from Access to Employment and Basic Services","Loosen ties between household registration with access to employment opportunities, especially employment in the public sector; access to other basic services (health, education).",""],[1,"75","3","Collective Bargaining Legal Framework Reform","Institutional reform, to create a legal framework to allow collective bargaining by workers with employers.",""],[1,"75","3","Overseas Labor Deployment Management and Efficiency Improvement","Strengthen management, expand the market and improve the efficiency of sending laborers to work overseas.",""],[1,"75","3","Public Employment Policy through Commune-Level Development Projects","Public employment policies are implemented through State-funded projects or activities associated with socio-economic development programs at the commune level, including: improving information on the job market for workers to raise awareness about new employment opportunities; construction of infrastructure for agriculture, forestry and fisheries; construction of public infrastructure; environmental protection and adaptation to climate change; projects and other activities serving the local community.",""],[1,"75","3","Priority Access for Vulnerable Workers in Public Employment Policy","Prioritize workers from ethnic minorities; poor people, poor households or households whose agricultural land were taken back; those who are unemployed or underemployed are prioritized to participate in public employment policy.",""]],"55":[[1,"81","3","Adoption of High-Yield Climate-Adapted Farming Techniques","Widely adopt new varieties of farming techniques with high yield, quality, efficiency and adapted to climate change.",""],[1,"81","3","Advanced Irrigation and Water-Saving Technology Deployment","Apply advanced irrigation, water saving technology.",""],[1,"90","4","Water Resource Development for Fisheries and Irrigation","Effectively promoting the potential of water resources, especially large reservoirs (hydropower and irrigation lakes ... ) in order to develop fisheries; rapidly developing export-oriented industrial plants (coffee, rubber, tea, cotton ... ) with the means of intensive cultivation, breeding large cattle, planting and protecting forests, medicinal plants, specialty crops and developing agricultural and forestry product processing industry.",""],[1,"90","4","Multi-purpose Hydropower and Irrigation Reservoir Development","Developing large and medium-scale, multi-purpose hydropower plants, water reservoirs for irrigation, with the purpose of storing water in the rainy season to combat drought in the dry season.",""]],"56":[[1,"81","4","New Rural Development Programme Implementation","Focus on effective implementation of the New Rural Development Programme.",""],[1,"81","4","Regional Rural Policy and Criteria Review","Review and improve mechanism, policy and rural development criteria to suit the peculiarities of each region.",""],[1,"81","4","Rural Socio-Economic Infrastructure Investment","prioritize the allocation of the state budget, preferential credit and mobilize resources outside of State to invest in building socio-economic infrastructure.",""],[1,"81","4","Rural Household and Farm Enterprise Development Policy","Have policies to encourage economic development in household, farm economy and attract enterprises to invest in production and business development in agriculture, industry and services in rural areas.",""],[1,"81","4","Settlement Reform for Shifting Cultivation and Nomadic Migration","Focus on resolving shifting cultivation, nomadic, free migration.",""],[1,"88","2","Poverty Reduction and New Rural Development Programs","effectively implementing poverty reduction programs and the new rural program",""],[1,"89","6","New Rural Areas and Agricultural Restructuring Programme","Focusing on building new rural areas; changing the structure of crops and livestocks, developing commodity production zones in order to raise income level and stabilize the people's lives.",""]],"57":[[1,"15","7","Social Security, Public Order, and Safety Measures","Synchronously implement measures to ensure the social security, order and safety.",""],[1,"15","7","Crime and Social Evil Prevention Effort","Strengthen the effort to prevent crimes and social evils and social ethics deterioration.",""],[1,"15","7","Information Network Security and Traffic Safety Measures","Strengthen information network security and safety; ensure traffic order, safety and reduce traffic accidents.",""],[1,"111","2","Social Security, Public Order, and Safety Measures","Implementing synchronous measures to ensure social security, orders and safety.",""],[1,"111","2","Social Discipline and Safety Promotion","Building social discipline and safety.",""],[1,"111","2","Social Evils and Crime Prevention and Control","Strengthening social evils and crime prevention and combatting.",""],[1,"111","2","Information Network Security Strengthening","Strengthening information network security.",""],[1,"111","2","Traffic Order, Safety, and Accident Reduction Measures","Ensuring traffic orders, safety and reducing traffic accidents.",""]],"61":[[1,"10","2","Urban Infrastructure Modernization and Housing Support","Step by step set up a system of urban areas with modern, synchronized and eco-friendly infrastructure, especially in greater urban areas.",""],[1,"10","2","Affordable Housing for Low-Income People and Industrial Workers","Encourage the construction of housing for people with low income and workers in industrial zones.",""]],"62":[[1,"12","2","Overseas Employment and Labour Export Support","Support the development of production, employment, training and bringing labours to overseas employments.",""],[1,"12","2","Foreign Labour Supervision Mechanism","Closely supervise foreign labours in Vietnam.",""]],"63":[[1,"14","4","Streamlined Civil Service Apparatus and Public Administration Competence Clarification","Strengthen the apparatus for streamlined and effective personnel; evaluate results and effectiveness of employment position determination in order to report to the National Assembly in late 2016; clearly define the scope of socio-economic public administration competence and responsibilities of all levels of government.",""],[1,"67","4","Modern Professional Public Administration Reform","Build a public administration that is modern, professional, dynamic, responsible, with serving the People and national interest as the highest goal.",""]],"64":[[1,"9","4","Private Sector Support and Equal Access Reform","Provide any support necessary for the healthy development of the private sector; perfect the laws and policies allowing private enterprises to have equal access to resources, especially capitals, land properties and natural resources.",""],[1,"9","4","Business Ownership and Joint-Stock Company Promotion","Encourage society participation in business ownership and manufacturing, as well as the development of joint- stock company model.",""],[1,"9","4","Small and Medium Enterprise Support","Support the development of small and medium enterprises, household economy and cooperative economy.",""],[1,"67","5","Private Enterprise Support and Enabling Business Environment","Create all favorable conditions to thrive Vietnamese enterprises, especially private enterprises, to serve as motivation for improving competitiveness and autonomy of the economy.",""]],"65":[[1,"16","5","Annual Implementation Planning and Mid-Term Reporting for the National Assembly Resolution","The Government, the Supreme People's Court, the Supreme People's Procuracy and the State Audit Office shall, according to their respective functions and tasks, formulate detailed plans for each year of the term, organize the effective implementation of the Resolution of the National Assembly; report mid-term results to the National Assembly in late 2018.",""],[1,"62","4","Leadership Quality Improvement and Forecasting Strengthening","Fifth, improve the quality of the leadership, following the country's reality to assess the situation properly and produce appropriate and timely guidelines, policies, goals and tasks and focus in implementing them drastically, creatively, concentrated and with long-term vision.",""],[1,"69","2","Implementation of Three Major Breakthrough Tasks","continue to implement the tasks to undertake 3 major breakthroughs that have been identified in the 2011-2020 10-year socio-economic development strategy",""]],"66":[[1,"14","4","Administrative Procedure Reform and E-Government Modernization","Perfect the administration procedures with the aim of improving policy and regulation quality to be more detailed, clear, transparent, easy-to-access and reduce inconvenience for business and people; promote transparency in administration procedures in each and every field and sector; mitigate the limitations and incompetence in law implementation and abiding.",""],[1,"44","5","Administrative Procedure Reform and Digitalization","Vietnam has been concentrating on reforming administrative procedures, applying information technology, gradually reforming the operations of state administrative agencies, publicizing and simplifying administrative procedures and shortening compliance time to save costs and time for",""],[1,"45","1","Transparency and Accountability Reform Measures","many policies to promote transparency and accountability have been implemented",""],[1,"45","1","State Management Efficiency Improvement","Vietnam has been continuing to improve operating methods and better the effectiveness and efficiency of State management",""],[1,"45","1","Administrative Discipline and Sanctions Strengthening","Discipline in state administrative bodies is strengthened",""]],"67":[[1,"8","7","State Budget Prioritization for Underserved Sectors","Focus the State budget into fields, which other sectors do not participate in.",""],[1,"11","1","Transport Infrastructure Funding for Low-Income Areas","Continue to prioritize funds for transportation infrastructure projects in low-income areas.",""],[1,"34","5","Prioritized Public Capital Investment Allocation","Investment capital was arranged to focus, prioritize projects of national importance, the national target programs, and the poverty reduction target; for mountainous areas, ethnic minority areas, border and island; minimize the number of new projects commenced.",""]],"68":[[1,"13","2","Ethnic Cultural Heritage Preservation and Promotion","Preserve and promote valuable cultural heritages and values of ethnic communities in Viet Nam.",""],[1,"13","2","Ethnic and Religious Policy Implementation","Ensure appropriate and complete implementation of policies on ethnic groups, religions and the freedom of religion.",""]],"69":[[1,"38","4","State Budget Increase for Social Policy Implementation","has increased the state budget and mobilize resources for better implementation of social policies, with priority to remote areas, disaster areas and ethnic minorities.",""]],"70":[[1,"8","5","Market-Based Socialist-Oriented Economic Development","Develop a market-based socialism-oriented economy, stabilize the macro- economy, create the environment and drive for socio-economic development",""],[1,"8","6","Macroeconomic Stabilization and Fiscal Management Reform","Effectively coordinate monetary, fiscal and other policies to ensure macro-economic stabilization and economic balances.",""],[1,"9","2","Trade Balance and Macroeconomic Stability Measures","Assure and improve the stability of economic balances, aim for trade balance surplus, formulate a process to gradually lessen the imbalance in trade relations with several countries contributing to the stability of the macro-economy",""],[1,"62","5","Macroeconomic Stability and Competitiveness Improvement","Maintain macroeconomic balances, improve competitiveness and expand and better the effectiveness of international integration.",""]],"71":[[1,"8","7","Medium-Term Public Investment Planning Reform","Transfer the public investment management method from annual plans to 5-year medium-term plans; improve investment efficiency.",""],[1,"8","7","Public Investment Fund Adjustment","Appropriately adjust the public investment fund to Central",""],[1,"33","6","Public Investment Restructuring Reform","Focus on implementing the restructuring of public investment, the system of",""],[1,"34","2","Public Investment Restructuring and Management Improvement","the task of restructuring public investment has been strongly implemented in developing institutions and improving management in all phases of public investment.",""],[1,"34","7","Public Investment Regulatory and Planning Decrees","Decree on guiding the implementation of some articles of the Law on Public Investment; (2) the Decree on the annual and medium-term public investment plan; (3) Decree on investment in the form of public-private partnership (PPP); (4) Decree on monitoring and evaluation of investment; (5) Decree on projects of national importance.",""],[1,"35","2","Investment Management and Prioritization Reform","Strengthen the management, proactively review and focus on investment for projects, important, urgent projects and reciprocal capital for ODA projects, overcoming the status of spread, wasteful, ineffective investment.",""],[1,"35","3","Decentralized Investment Approval and Allocation Reform","Improve mechanisms of decentralization of investment, strengthen the autonomy and activeness, accompany with the improvement of the responsibilities of different levels, sectors, localities and investors in approve process of investment projects, selection and allocation for each specific project in accordance with the objectives and orientations for development and capital allocation principles.",""],[1,"35","4","Public and Transparent Capital Allocation","Ensure the public and transparency of capital allocation, which has contributed significantly to redress the harassment and strengthen the prevention of corruption in the state apparatus.",""]],"72":[[1,"9","2","Goods Quality Improvement and National Brand Development","Improve the quality of goods; create more national-brand goods.",""],[1,"9","2","Domestic Production Protection and Consumer Rights Enforcement","Exercise proper methods to protect domestic productions and rights and benefits of the consumers.",""]],"73":[[1,"9","2","Market Price Liberalization for Goods and Public Services","Fully exercise market mechanism with goods prices and gradually with prices of public services.",""],[1,"12","5","Health Financing Procedure and Price Reform","Renovate the financial procedures and adjust the prices of health care services in line with the roadmap, ensure the prices are",""],[1,"28","2","Market Price Reform Roadmap","Has implemented market prices roadmap for petroleum, coal, electricity, water, education, healthcare ... , which is associated with the support of policy beneficiaries, the poor and disadvantaged.",""],[1,"41","3","Health Insurance Pricing Reform and Subsidy Expansion","Gradually implemented roadmap to calculate correctly and fully medical service prices to shift budgetary recurrent expenditures allocated to the hospital recently to support people to participate in health insurance; will have positive impact to encourage people to participate in health insurance.",""]],"74":[[1,"9","6","Regional Connectivity and Cooperation Management Mechanism","Formulate a management mechanism for regional connecting and cooperation model.",""],[1,"9","6","Special Economic Zone Development in Key Economic Zones","Select a number of zones with significant advantages to form special economic zone with specialized and effective mechanism, and widespread effect on agricultural production structure transition,",""],[1,"10","1","Economic Perimeter Development and Regional Connectivity","Develop economic perimeters and connect with other countries in the region.",""],[1,"10","1","Economic and Industrial Zone Allocation Reform","Properly allocate economic and industrial zones with the aim of regional economic transition.",""]],"75":[[1,"12","5","Primary Health Care and Disease Prevention Strengthening","Attend to primary health care service, develop the preventive health care, and actively prevent diseases to avoid widespread epidemics.",""],[1,"40","3","Preventive Medicine and Epidemic Prevention","Has well-implemented preventive medicine, in order to prevent major epidemics to occur.",""],[1,"40","3","Hygiene Management and Food Safety","Focus on hygiene management, food safety.",""]],"76":[[1,"13","6","Water Source Protection and Water Infrastructure Development","Protect the water sources, construct the infrastructure to utilize effectively and economically water resource; ensure enough water which is supplied for the production and consumption of enterprises and the people.",""],[1,"13","6","Drought, Saltwater Intrusion, and Sea Level Rise Prevention Projects","Firstly, in 2016, invest in several projects to prevent droughts, saltwater intrusion, and sea level rise in Southern-Central, Central Highlands and Mekong Delta provinces.",""],[1,"13","6","Mekong River Water Resource Management and Protection","Consistently protect our nation's interests in sustainably manage and utilize the Mekong River's water resource.",""]],"77":[[1,"14","4","Public Sector Digitalization and E-Government Expansion","Boost the application of information technology into the activities of public agencies, public service provision and conduct e-Government.",""]],"78":[[1,"15","6","Integrated National Defence and Security with Socio-Economic Development","Combine national defence and security with socio-economics development.",""],[1,"15","6","Border Area Peace and Cooperation Development","Build peaceful, friendly, cooperative and developed border areas.",""],[1,"15","6","Defence Economic Zone Efficiency Enhancement","Enhance the efficiency of defence economic zones.",""]],"79":[[1,"16","3","Enterprise Technology and Standards Upgrading Support","Support enterprises to modernize the technology, apply developed countries' standard on environment, food safety for Viet Nam's export goods, improve the perception about and the ability to implement international regulations on geographical indications, origin of goods, copyright, brand, etc.",""]],"80":[[1,"43","3","Youth Development Strategy Implementation","Youth development strategy for 2011-2020 has been being actively implemented.",""]],"81":[[1,"17","2","Patriotic Emulation and National Unity Mobilization","The National Assembly appeals the fellow citizens and combatants nationwide and our compatriots abroad to heighten the spirit of patriotic emulation and unity, to spare no efforts and seize favorable opportunities to overcome difficulties and challenges to successfully implement the five-year socio-economic plan in 2016 - 2020 period.",""]],"82":[[1,"70","3","National Information and Media Systems Development","Develop information and national media systems; develop irrigation systems, river dykes, sea dykes; works to cope with climate change and prevention of natural disasters, storms and floods.",""],[1,"94","1","Climate-Resilient Infrastructure Investment","Prioritizing the investment of infrastructure that answer the need to respond to climate change and rising sea levels.",""],[1,"94","2","Large-Scale Irrigation and Flood Drainage Infrastructure","Completing large-scale irrigation system10, system of channels and sewers for flood drainage in combination with irrigation, alkali reduction and salinity prevention for the localities in the Mekong Delta region11.",""],[1,"94","2","Aquaculture Infrastructure Projects","Some large-scale projects in aqua-cultural infrastructure are expected to be completed12.",""],[1,"94","6","Bao Dinh Project System Phase 2","11 Bao Dinh project system (phase 2) in the territory of the provinces of Tien Giang, Long An; An Phong - My Hoa - Bac Dong channel in the territory of the provinces of Dong Thap, Long An, Tien Giang; Dong Tien - Lagrange channel in the territory of the provinces of Dong Thap, Long An ;...",""],[1,"94","7","Storm Shelters for Fishing Boats","Storm shelters for boats in Ly Son island, Quang Ngai province; storm shelters for fishing boats in Phu Quy island, Binh Thuan province ;...",""]],"83":[[1,"70","3","Education, Health, and Social Infrastructure Investment","Invest in development of infrastructure of education and training, health, culture, ... and other social benefits.",""],[1,"89","1","Construction of Research, Training, and High-Quality Medical Centers","continuing to invest in the construction of research, training and high- quality medical centers conforming to the regional and international standards in Ha Noi, Hai Phong, Nam Dinh ...",""],[1,"93","6","Strategic Infrastructure Construction Acceleration","Accelerating the strategic implementation of constructing infrastructure systems in synchronization with some modern works.",""],[1,"94","1","Tertiary Hospital Construction","Completing the construction of tertiary hospitals.",""],[1,"95","6","Rural Infrastructure, Education, and Health Socialization Initiative","Enhancing socialization in the field of investments, especially in developing infrastructures, education and medical services in rural areas.",""]],"84":[[1,"71","6","National Reserves Expenditure Budget Reclassification","national reserves expenditure is split into a separate expenditure outside of capital and recurrent expenditure; capital investment from government bonds, local budget deficit, revenues from the sale of stakes owned by the State at some enterprises are incorporated into the state budget balance.",""],[1,"72","2","State Budget Expenditure Restructuring","Continue to restructure State budget expenditures for the objectives of maintaining the growth recovery momentum, ensuring national defense, security and social welfares in the new situation, reducing recurrent expenditures.",""],[1,"72","2","Investment of SOE Equitisation Revenue in Infrastructure","Moreover, part of revenue from State-owned enterprises equitisation shall be invested in transportation, health care, education, etc. infrastructures.",""],[1,"96","1","Development Infrastructure Financing Mix","Changing the ratio of development investment expenditure in the total amount of State Budget expenditure, and at the same time continuing to issue Government bonds and using a part of the income from the privatization of State-owned enterprises to add into capital used for the development of economic and social infrastructures.",""]],"85":[[1,"73","4","Competition Legislation and Market Competition Reform","Finalize competition legislation by assigning greater powers to the competition authorities; ensure equality among economic sectors.",""],[1,"73","4","Competition Institutions and Enforcement Capacity Building","Develop institutions to ensure effective competition on the market, build capacity of law enforcement in protecting competition, control market monopolies, monitoring of phenomena of linked market control between businesses, preventing the market entry of new businesses.",""],[1,"73","4","Consumer Protection Legal Framework Finalization","Finalize the legal framework for consumer protection.",""],[1,"74","2","Competition Policy and Monopoly Control Enforcement","control monopolies, effectively enforce policies for healthy competition.",""]],"86":[[1,"74","1","Public Investment Law Enforcement","Implement strictly and effectively the Law on Public Investment.",""],[1,"74","1","Institutional Public Investment Capital Reallocation","Renew institutional investment capital allocation in line with the role and function of each state agency in the market economy and in line with decentralization between the central and local levels.",""],[1,"74","1","Local Government Performance Assessment Reform","Redefine criteria and ways of assessing the performance of local government, reduce quantitative targets and increase the number of qualitative indicators, particularly indicators in the social and environment sector.",""],[1,"77","4","Fiscal Management and Public Investment Reform","Strengthen management and gradually restructure revenues and expenditures policies, consolidate financial sustainability while ensuring appropriate investment in socio-economic infrastructure, step up national financial reserve to be able to deal with major \"shocks\" from the outside.",""],[1,"78","7","Public Investment Mobilization and Allocation Reform","Strengthen the mobilization of resources for investment in development.",""],[1,"79","1","Priority Infrastructure Investment and State Capital Allocation Reform","giving priority to key, urgent infrastructure projects.",""],[1,"94","4","Infrastructure Project Governance and Delivery Strengthening","Strengthening governance, ensuring progress according to schedule, efficiency and quality of projects, preventing loss and wastage of resources.",""],[1,"95","3","Public Investment Restructuring","Continuing restructuring investments, with the core being public investments, in accordance to regulations set out in the Prime Minister's Decision No. 339/QĐ-TTg dated 19th February 2013 on approving the general proposal on the restructuring of the economy alongside changes on the growth model focusing on enhancing quality, effectiveness and competitiveness for the period 2013-2020, including:",""],[1,"95","7","Public Investment Law Implementation Strengthening","Line ministries and government authority at all levels must enhance directing and implementing regulations stipulated in the Public Investment Laws.",""],[1,"95","7","Investment Process Efficiency Measures","Enhancing measures in all stages of the investment process to ensure investments are carried out in a focused manner, alleviating the dispersion of investment capital in order to promote investment efficiency.",""],[1,"96","2","Public Procurement and Contractor Selection Improvement","Improving the quality of the procurement process and selection of contractors, ensuring that the chosen contractors are fully capable of carrying out projects in a timely manner.",""],[1,"96","3","Public Investment Audit, Inspection, and Monitoring Strengthening","Enhancing the auditing, inspecting and monitoring activities on all stages of the investment process, especially on public investments.",""],[1,"96","3","Public Oversight and Accountability for Investment Violations","Enhancing the monitoring role of the local public; clearly outlining the responsibilities of any agencies or individuals who violate legislations regulating public investments and creating wastage of public investment resources.",""],[1,"97","2","Harmonization of Public Investment Procedures and Legal Framework","Continuing to harmonize procedures between Vietnam's and those of foreign sponsors, polishing the legal framework in a way that adopts international standards in order to consistently and effectively monitor public investment capital, including ODA capital and preferential loans from foreign sponsors.",""],[1,"97","3","Public Procurement and Open Bidding Reform","Enhancing open bidding, ensuring clarity, fairness and economic efficiency.",""],[1,"97","4","Investment Inspection and Monitoring Enhancement","Enhancing the inspecting and monitoring activities on investments.",""],[1,"97","5","Focused Public Investment Capital Allocation","Allocating capital in a focused manner in order to finish and speed up schedules for ... Assigning small-scale projects to the responsibility of local budgets and mobilizing capital from other legal sources to invest.",""],[1,"97","5","Construction Arrears Clearance and Prevention","Also, focusing capital in order to pay back all construction arrears according to regulations set out in the Public Investment Laws and preventing construction arrears from occurring.",""],[1,"97","5","Priority Public Investment for Disadvantaged Regions","Continuing to prioritize State Budget investments in mountainous regions, regions occupied by ethnic minority, frontiers, islands and other regions with economic difficulties.",""],[1,"97","5","Medium-Term Public Investment Planning","Allocating capital according to the 5 year medium term investment plan stipulated in the Public Investments Laws, conforming to the socio-economic development plan.",""]],"87":[[1,"74","2","Property Rights and Business Freedom Protection","The State shall protect legitimate property rights and the freedom of doing business for people and enterprises in accordance with the law;",""],[1,"74","2","Equal and Safe Investment and Business Environment Reform","create investment and business environment of equality, safety and convenience;",""],[1,"74","2","State-Owned Enterprise Market Mechanism Reform","Set SOEs to operate under market mechanisms, specify the tasks of production and business according to market mechanisms and perform tasks assigned by the State.",""],[1,"74","2","Socio-Economic Infrastructure and Human Resource Development","Focus on developing socio- economic infrastructure, human resources and scientific, technology potential.",""],[1,"74","2","Administrative Reform Acceleration","Step up administrative reform.",""],[1,"74","3","Property Rights Institutionalization and Administrative Procedure Transparency Reform","Institutionalize the property rights of the State, organizations and individuals as established in the 2013 Constitution.",""],[1,"74","3","Business Environment and Regulatory Reform Package","Continue to apply the solutions for improving business environment, enhance the national competitiveness, focus on complete reforms of regulations on conditional business activities, regulations on export-import management, regulations on administrative procedures regarding investments, land properties, construction and environment; create and strengthen the safety, reduce costs and risks and facilitate investment and business activities; strengthen the capacity of related organizations and agencies in carrying out State management in said fields.",""],[1,"74","4","Economic and Trade Dispute Settlement Capacity Improvement","Improve effectiveness and efficiency of economic and trade dispute settlement in the context that the country is developing and integrating internationally, focusing on improving the capacity of arbitration.",""],[1,"74","4","Citizen and Civil Society Participation in Policy and Law Oversight","Promote the role of citizens, businesses, social, political and community organizations participating in the construction, judgment and supervising the implementation of policies and laws.",""],[1,"74","4","Mass and Trade Association Rights Protection Support","Enhance the role of mass organizations, trade associations, consumer associations in protecting the rights of citizens and enterprises.",""],[1,"95","2","Investment Climate Simplification and Legal Framework Reform","Continuing to scrutinize in order to simplify and establish favorable economic conditions, stabilize policies and legal framework for the sake of promoting investments into businesses from both domestic and international investors.",""],[1,"95","7","Business Environment Legal Reform","Effectively promulgating and implementing decrees and legal documents instructing on the execution of laws that have been passed by the National Congress, especially legal documents relating to the creation of business environments that are favorable and fair to both domestic and international enterprises.",""]],"88":[[1,"74","5","Market Diversification and Efficiency Improvement","Diversify and improve the operational efficiency of markets for goods, services, finance, currency, real estate, labor, science and technology, ... satisfying socio-economic development requirements.",""],[1,"74","5","Domestic Production and Consumption Promotion","Encourage production and domestic consumption and develop a synchronized, efficient distribution system.",""],[1,"79","2","Domestic Market Development and Trade Balance Management","Develop the domestic market, promote export, control import accordingly, strive for sustainable trade balance",""],[1,"79","3","Domestic Market Development and Retail Linkage Programme","Strongly develop the domestic market, focus on linking production, processing and distribution, thereby reduce intermediaries, save costs, reduce prices and increase the competitiveness of domestic products.",""],[1,"79","3","Large-Scale Retail System Development","At the same time promote the development of large-scale retail system with linkages similar to above.",""],[1,"79","3","Vietnamese Goods Preference Campaign","Continue to implement effectively \"Vietnamese prioritize using Vietnamese goods\" campaign.",""],[1,"79","4","Market Price Mechanism and Price Management Reform","Consistent implement market-price mechanism for goods and services in the economy, and appropriately support policy beneficiaries, the poor, ethnic minorities.",""],[1,"79","4","Supply-Demand Balance for Essential Goods and Services","Ensure balanced supply - demand, especially essential goods and services.",""],[1,"79","4","Anti-Smuggling and Trade Fraud Prevention Measures","Focus on promoting the prevention of smuggling and trade fraud.",""],[1,"83","5","Wholesale and Retail Distribution System Development","Develop a comprehensive system of wholesale and retail distribution.",""],[1,"83","5","E-commerce and Vietnam Goods Branding Promotion","Focus on developing e-commerce and branding of Vietnam goods.",""],[1,"83","5","Domestic Market Linkage and Distribution Network Coordination","Strengthen the connection between manufacturing enterprises, distributors, associations and management agencies to flourish domestic and foreign markets.",""]],"89":[[1,"74","6","Financial Market Development and Currency Market Improvement","Develop the financial market, debt trading markets, derivative financial instruments and assets leasing, ... Improve the performance of the currency market;",""],[1,"75","1","Financial Market Liberalization and Development","open credit markets and banking services to meet development requirements and in accordance with international commitments.",""],[1,"75","1","Stock and Bond Market Development","Promote activities and improve the efficiency of the stock market, bond market to become a channel for capital mobilization of medium and long-term importance to the economy and gradually reduce dependence on banks.",""],[1,"75","1","Insurance Market Development and Liberalization","Develop the insurance market, open market access under committed road map; diversify and improve the quality of insurance products.",""],[1,"78","2","Capital Market Development and Efficiency Improvement","Strongly develop and improve the efficiency of the stock, bonds, debt trading markets ... meeting development requirements and in accordance with international commitments.",""],[1,"83","6","Financial and Business Support Services Improvement","Develop and improve the quality of financial services, banking, securities, insurance and other business support services.",""]],"90":[[1,"78","1","State Loan Management and Guarantee Reduction Reform","management and efficient use of state loans; strictly control, gradually decrease loan guarantees by the government, local government borrowing and lending by state- owned enterprises.",""],[1,"78","3","Public Debt Management Legal and Regulatory Reform","Perfect the system of legal documents related to the management of public debt in line with the Law on State Budget of 2015, Law on Public Investment and other newly enacted laws.",""],[1,"78","3","Public Debt Lending and Guarantee Regulation Enhancement","Supplement and improve regulations on the conditions for use of capital for lending, guaranteeing from public debt capital in the direction of improving accountability in the allocation and management of public debt if the investment project is inefficient due to subjective factors.",""],[1,"78","3","Public Debt Ceiling and Sustainability Framework","Determine the appropriate level of public debt in order to create effective leverage of the country, ensuring the sustainability of fiscal policies and to drive economic growth.",""],[1,"78","3","Public Debt Restructuring and Maturity Extension","Restructure public debt in the direction of increasing the proportion of long-term debt, increasing the share of domestic debt to reduce repayment pressure in the short-term and foreign debt risks as the global economy, finance fluctuates.",""],[1,"78","3","Public Debt On-Lending and Allocation Ratio Adjustment","Increase gradually re-lending proportion, decrease gradually allocation proportion.",""],[1,"78","4","Fiscal, Public Investment, and Public Debt Coordination Mechanism","Have mechanisms to strengthen tight coordination between fiscal policy, public investment and public debt management.",""],[1,"78","5","Public Debt Information and Reporting Exchange","Strengthening the exchange of information and reports on public debt, consistent with the commitment to provide information to international organizations and the current provisions of the law of Vietnam.",""],[1,"78","6","Reform of Investment Credit and Export Credit Mechanisms","Renovate investment credit and export credit mechanisms by the State at Vietnam Development Bank in the direction of eliminating State debt freezing, debt relief mechanisms for investment loans and export business.",""],[1,"78","6","Strengthened Loan Management and Project Selection","Strengthen strict management of loans, improve conditions for guarantee, select truly necessary projects and balance funds to repay.",""],[1,"78","6","Loan Inspection and Supervision Mechanism","Strengthen inspection and supervision of the use of loans, ensuring investment efficiency, work quality and in accordance with the law.",""],[1,"96","5","ODA and Preferential Loan Management Reform","Regarding official development assistance (ODA) capital and preferential loans from foreign sponsors, in order to facilitate the most favorable conditions in environments, legal institutions, processes, procedures in attracting, monitoring and utilizing these capital, the following measures are needed:",""],[1,"96","6","ODA and Preferential Loan Monitoring and Utilization Policy Completion","Carrying on the completion of policies and legal institutions regarding monitoring and utilizing ODA capital and preferential loans, conforming to the changes in the legal system and cooperation environment, including the implementation of the Proposal named \"Orientations on attracting, monitoring and utilizing ODA capital and preferential loans from international sponsors for the period 2016 - 2020\"13 and also the new Government Decree replacing Decree No. 38/2013/ND-CP dated 23rd April 2013 on monitoring and utilizing official",""]],"91":[[1,"80","2","Economic Restructuring and Growth Model Innovation Scheme","Continue to implement strong, coordinated, efficient overall scheme to restructure the economy associated with the growth model innovation, improve productivity, efficiency and competitiveness of the economy.",""]],"92":[[1,"81","2","State Farm and Forestry Enterprise Restructuring","Continue to restructure, innovate, improve operational efficiency of companies and State farms, forestry farms7, contributing to the development of agriculture and forestry, and to support farmers in poor areas, especially areas of extreme hardship.",""],[1,"81","5","Implementation Plan for Resolution 30 on Agriculture and Forestry Company Reform","Programme under Decision No. 686/QĐ-TTg dated 11/05/2014 of the Prime Minister to implement Resolution 30 of the Politburo.",""]],"93":[[1,"82","1","Rural Literacy and Health Improvement Initiative","Focus on improving literacy, health care, job creation, poverty reduction, social security, public order and environmental protection.",""],[1,"82","1","National Unity and Political System Strengthening","Build a strong political system and strengthen the national unity bloc.",""],[1,"92","2","Social Policy and Social Security Strengthening","Implementing well social policies and ensuring social security, combatting and preventing social evils and crimes, reducing traffic accidents.",""]],"94":[[1,"84","1","Marine Resource and Environment Baseline Survey","Accelerate the basic survey on resources, the marine environment, islands.",""],[1,"84","1","Island Settlement Support Policy","Create favorable conditions and encourage people to settle permanently on the island.",""],[1,"84","1","Marine Search and Rescue and Safety Strengthening","Strengthen search and rescue, security, safety at seas and islands.",""]],"95":[[1,"86","1","Foreign Investment Attraction and Policy Reform","Review, amend laws and policies to attract foreign investment, especially for industries with advanced technology, environmental friendliness, high value-added products, and high ratio of localization.",""],[1,"86","1","Priority Investment Promotion in Strategic Sectors","Encourage investment in infrastructure, supporting industries, renewable energy, new material industry, information technology, bio-tech, new crops, human resources training, and medical industry, etc.",""],[1,"96","4","Selective Foreign Direct Investment Promotion and Screening Policy","Regarding foreign direct investments, there exists a need for policies prioritizing technologically advanced and environmental friendly projects.",""],[1,"96","4","Foreign Investment Project Inspection and Monitoring Enhancement","At the same time, enhancing the inspection and monitoring of the licensing and managing process of foreign investment projects, ensuring cohesion and efficiency of the economy.",""],[1,"96","4","Targeted Investment Promotion by Sector and Partner","Changing the ways investments are promoted, focusing on the key sector of each line industry, field, area and partner.",""],[1,"96","4","Business Community Policy Dialogue Mechanism","Enhancing on policy dialogues with the business community in order to solve any problems foreign investors in Vietnam may have (on-the-spot investment promotion).",""]],"96":[[1,"86","3","Regional Planning and Development Management Reform","Completing regional planning and using planning as the basis for regional development management.",""],[1,"86","3","Planning Quality and Transparency Improvement","Improving the qualities of planning establishment and management, especially socio-economic infrastructure planning, urban planning and resource usage planning, ensuring publicity and transparency.",""],[1,"86","3","Development of Key Economic Regions and Industrial Parks","Emphasizing the development of key economic regions, dynamic regions, economic zones and industrial parks.",""],[1,"86","3","Regional Connectivity Enhancement","Enhancing the connection between regional localities and between",""],[1,"87","1","Regional Development Coordination Mechanism","Researching for mechanisms for management of coordinated regional development.",""],[1,"87","1","Industrial and Economic Zone Planning and Legal Reform","Continuing to improve the quality of the construction, implementing the planning and improving the legislation and policy mechanism to promote the efficiency of available industrial and economic zones.",""],[1,"87","1","Cross-Border Economic Zone Feasibility Study","Considering the formation of some cross-border economic zones.",""],[1,"87","5","Inter-Regional Technical Infrastructure Modernization","Gradually modernizing the technical infrastructure system for inter-regional",""],[1,"88","1","Connectivity and Economic Zone Infrastructure Development","connectivity such as highways, national highways, railways, airports; building focal engineering works such as urban water supply and drainage systems; industrial park and border economic zone infrastructure to meet the demands for development.",""],[1,"88","4","Inter-Regional and Inter-Provincial Cooperation and Policy Coordination","Strengthening inter-regional, inter-provincial cooperation, linking and synchronizing policies, directions and execution in the implementation of planning and investment promotion, expanding product markets; exploiting, utilizing and protecting the sustainability of water resources and the environment.",""],[1,"89","2","Regional Infrastructure Development and Key Projects Mobilization","Developing the infrastructure system with the focus on key projects.",""],[1,"91","4","Regional Economic Integration and Unified Economic Space","Strengthening regional links, establishing an unified economic space to promote the comparative advantages of each province, city and the whole region, establishing",""],[1,"93","6","Socio-economic Infrastructure Planning Improvement","Improving the quality of socio- economic infrastructure construction planning, ensuring comprehensive efficiency and systematic characteristic, especially networks of transportation, electricity, water, irrigation, education, healthcare, telecommunication infrastructure and information technology.",""]],"97":[[1,"87","1","Special Economic Zone Development","Selecting zones with special advantages to establish special economic zones with advanced institutions, efficiency and effectiveness, capable of international competition.",""],[1,"87","1","Economic Corridor and Belt Development","Developing economic corridors and belts to effectively connect to other countries in the area.",""],[1,"87","1","Border Economic Zone Development","Developing border economic zones.",""],[1,"87","4","Border Economic Zone Development","Focusing on the development of border economic zones.",""],[1,"90","2","Economic Zone Infrastructure Completion for Investment Attraction","Focusing on the completion of infrastructure for economic zones in order to attract investments from enterprises.",""],[1,"91","1","Border Economy and Services Development","Promoting the development of border economy and services in transportation, telecommunications, finance, banking, insurance, technology transfer and other services for production and livelihood of the people.",""],[1,"91","1","Market-Based Economic Zone Siting","Considering the market demand when selecting the locations to establish new economic zones.",""]],"98":[[1,"81","2","Food Safety Risk Management Capacity Strengthening","Strengthen the capacity to manage food safety risks.",""],[1,"88","7","Clean and High-Value Agricultural Product Development","Focusing on the development of agricultural sector with clean, environment- friendly, high productivity and high value products with the potential for exporting;",""],[1,"88","7","Agricultural Land Preservation for Food Security","and also maintaining the land funds utilized for the sake of national food security.",""]],"99":[[1,"102","3","Public Employment and Unemployment Insurance Support","Implementing well the policies of public employment, unemployment insurance, time-limited support for people losing jobs in public sector.",""],[1,"103","1","Labor Market Information and Employment Services Strengthening","Strengthening activities regarding labor market information, organizing consultation, job placement and labor supply of employment service centers, creating conditions for employees who have lost their jobs to quickly find jobs.",""],[1,"103","1","Employment Support, Vocational Training, and Overseas Labor Deployment","Providing support on production development, creating jobs, improving vocational training and sending labor overseas.",""],[1,"103","1","Social Security Fund Sustainability Reform","Expanding the audience and improving the efficiency of the system, innovating financial mechanisms, ensuring sustainable development of social security funds.",""]],"100":[[1,"103","2","Wage and Salary Policy Reform","Reforming policies in wages and salaries following market regulations and in line with labor productivity growth.",""],[1,"103","2","Minimum Wage and Basic Salary Adjustment Mechanism","Adjusting basic level of salary and minimum wage following an appropriate schedule, ensuring the minimum living standards for people in employment and retirees.",""],[1,"103","2","Trade Union Effectiveness Improvement","Improving the efficiency of trade unions so that they truly represent the rights of employees and resolve conflicts in a timely manner.",""],[1,"103","2","Labor Relations Dialogue and Wage Agreement Mechanism","Implementing mechanisms for dialogue and wage agreement between parties, building harmonious and progressive labor relations.",""],[1,"103","2","Collective Labor Agreement Co-Monitoring Mechanism","Establishing mechanisms that allow trade unions, organizations that represent employees and organizations that represent employers to co-monitor the implementation of collective labor agreements.",""],[1,"103","2","Foreign Labor Supervision Strengthening","Strengthening the supervision of foreign labor in Vietnam.",""],[1,"103","2","State Enterprise Salary Policy Improvement","Continuing to improve salary policies for State enterprises.",""],[1,"103","2","Labor Management Standards and Productivity Assessment System","Establishing systems of labor management standards and labor productivity assessment criterion.",""],[1,"103","2","Labor Protection Policy Implementation","Implementing well the policies for labor protection.",""]],"101":[[1,"104","3","Medicinal Industry and Traditional Medicine Development","Encouraging the development of medicinal industry and traditional medicine.",""],[1,"104","3","Medicine and Medical Equipment Procurement Management","Strengthening procurement management of medicines and medical equipments.",""],[1,"104","3","Essential Medicines, Vaccines, Blood Products and Medical Equipment Supply","Ensuring adequate supply of medicines, vaccines, biological, blood, blood-derived products and quality medical equipments to meet the people's demands for disease treatment and prevention.",""],[1,"104","3","Food Hygiene Improvement","Strengthening food hygiene.",""],[1,"104","3","Population and Family Planning Programme","Focusing on population and family planning, resolving the problem of gender imbalance at birth.",""]],"102":[[1,"105","1","Inspection, Enforcement, and Public Awareness for Environmental Compliance","Focusing on the inspection and strictly handling violations; also enhancing information and communication with the people to raise awareness, consciousness and responsibilities.",""],[1,"105","3","Natural Resource Prospecting, Planning, and Monitoring Reform","Improving the prospecting and evaluating activities on the potential and reserve of natural resources, completing the planning and strengthening management and monitoring of resources, utilizing resources in an appropriate, effective and economical manner.",""],[1,"105","3","Mineral Extraction Environmental Protection Measures","Exploiting and utilizing minerals in connection with environmental protection, minimizing exports of raw materials.",""],[1,"105","3","Sustainable Natural Resource and Minerals Indicators Framework","Issuing a set of indicators for sustainable development of natural resources and minerals, including specific criterion in effective and economical exploitation of minerals; specific indicators for environmental protection in the exploitation and processing of minerals conforming to the technical and technological level of Vietnam.",""],[1,"105","3","Mine Closure Environmental Restoration Pilot","Piloting the renovation and restoration of the environment during the closure of certain mines/areas where mining activities have expired such as: coal mines in Quang Ninh province, apatite ore mines in Lao Cai province, iron ore mines in Thai Nguyen province, lead - zinc ore in Bac Kan province ... in order to build a standard model for certain groups/types of mineral and to replicate the said model.",""],[1,"105","3","Mineral Procurement in Extraction","Implementing procurement in exploitation of minerals.",""],[1,"105","4","Land Use Planning and Monitoring Reform","Improving the quality of planning and strictly monitoring the usage of lands.",""],[1,"105","4","Land Policy and Legislation Reform","Improving the system of policies and legislation regarding land usage to thoroughly address some issues in land mechanisms and policies in the following fields: planning, land usage planning; land withdrawal, land allocation, land lease, transfer of land use purpose; compensation, support and resettlement when the State recovers lands form",""],[1,"106","1","Land Administration and Valuation Reform","Improving the transparency on land valuation through the establishment of a price-publicizing mechanism in auctions and transactions of land use rights.",""],[1,"106","1","Independent Land Appraisal Agency Development","Accelerating the formation of an independent professional appraisal agency to appraise land use rights.",""],[1,"106","1","Land Policy Review and Amendment Mechanism","Organizing regular assessments on the impacts of land policies and legal regulations upon socio-economic development, ensuring the validity and effectiveness of enacted policies and laws; timely amending inappropriate policies.",""],[1,"106","1","Land Management Review of State Entities","Conducting reviews on the state of land management and land use of economic organizations, State-owned agro-forestry farms and public service organizations; the state of agricultural land allocation to households and individuals for stable and long-term use; identifying the boundaries for wet rice land parcels that need strict protection to ensure national food security.",""],[1,"106","1","National Land Measurement and Cadastral Mapping Programme","Basically completing the measurements and cadastral mapping for the whole area of used lands; in which the urban, suburban, rural residential areas and areas with high frequency of land transactions are to be prioritized; frequently updating changes in maps and cadastral records, ensuring fair reflection of the state of land usage.",""],[1,"106","1","Land Finance Policy and Anti-Speculation Measures","Building and completing financial procedures and policies regarding lands; researching for solutions to utilize financial tools in land management to prevent wasteful, inefficient land use, corruption and speculation.",""],[1,"106","1","Strengthened Land Inspection and Enforcement","Strengthening the inspection and handling of violations in land management and usage, ensuring legality and conformity to planning.",""],[1,"106","2","Transboundary Water Resource Protection and Monitoring","actively cooperating internationally in the protection and use of transboundary water resources.",""],[1,"106","2","Water Exploitation and Waste Discharge Control","Controlling water exploitation facilities and waste discharge on river basins, focusing effort on subjects that exploit and use large amounts of water, that discharge large amounts of wastewater though water resource surveillance systems.",""],[1,"106","2","Sanitary Protection Zone Regulation for Water Sources","Establishing regulations regarding sanitary protection zones for water used in daily life; implementing regulations regarding sanitary protection zones, prohibited areas, underground water exploitation zone.",""],[1,"106","2","Polluted Water Source Restoration Measures","Establishing criteria to identify, classify and take measures to restore polluted, degraded and depleted water sources; focusing on a number of rivers experiencing serious pollution and depletion.",""],[1,"106","2","Public Disclosure of Polluting Water Facilities","Publicizing lists of facilities that exploit and use water resources, discharge wastewater into water sources that cause serious pollution, degradation and depletion of water resources.",""],[1,"106","2","Joint Reservoir Operations Reform","Reviewing and completing the operating procedures for joint reservoirs in river basins; ensuring that 100% of large-scale reservoirs are operated in a joint basis.",""],[1,"106","2","Minimum Flow and Groundwater Extraction Limits","Identifying and announcing the minimum flows of 70% of mainstreams in large river basins; and also the limit for underground water exploitation of key economic zones.",""]],"103":[[1,"108","2","Market Economy Legal and Institutional Framework Development","Focusing on establishing institutions, laws, mechanisms, policies and the environment, creating favorable and safe conditions to allow adequate, thorough, efficient operation of the market economy and international integration; strongly promoting democracy and freedom of creativity of the people in socio-economic development.",""],[1,"109","3","Administrative Procedure Reform and E-Government Enhancement","Focusing on administrative procedure reform with the purpose of streamlining, along with improving the quality of policies and laws and clearly assigning responsibilities of administrative procedures to agencies.",""]],"104":[[1,"112","2","Implementation of the 2016-2020 Socio-Economic Development Plan","The implementation of the 5-year socio-economic development plan for the period 2016 - 2020 is the key mission of all government levels, sectors, enterprises and the people.",""],[1,"112","4","Comprehensive Dissemination of Development Objectives and Orientations","Organizing comprehensive dissemination of objectives, missions, development orientation to all government levels and sectors, unifying ideologies, viewpoints and development orientations for the economy set out in the Party's Twelfth Congress Resolution and the National Assembly's Resolution.",""],[1,"112","5","Action Programs for the 2016-2020 Socio-Economic Development Plan","the Government is to establish and carry out action programs to implement the National Assembly's Resolution on the 5-year socio-economic development plan for the period 2016 - 2020.",""],[1,"112","5","Continuation of the Three Major Breakthroughs","Continuing to implement the three major breakthroughs.",""],[1,"112","5","Sectoral and Local Planning Review and Approval","Directing ministries, sectors and localities to review, complete planning and approve the 5-year socio-economic development plans for each sector and locality and also the national objective programs;",""],[1,"112","5","Continuation of Economic Restructuring and Growth Model Reform","building and directing the continuation of the economic restructuring process, changing the growth model;",""],[1,"112","5","Innovation of Governing Mechanisms and Government Capacity Improvement","the continuation of researches to innovate governing mechanisms and improve the governing capability and efficiency of government apparatus.",""],[1,"112","6","Annual Socio-Economic Development Planning Alignment","Specifying objectives and criteria for development orientation of the 5-year plan in each of the annual socio-economic development plans for the period, also implementing solutions suitable to the unique characteristics of each sector and locality.",""],[1,"112","7","Implementation Monitoring and Mid-Term Evaluation Mechanism","Strengthening the monitoring and evaluating of the state of implementation within the year and also holding mid-term evaluation on the state of implementation of",""]]}});